<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga unogile wandikigwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga unogile wandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga unogile kama vuwandikigwe na Luka Womlagusa Yesu kwa mhande mbili mosi kama lagano da ulohozi kwa Waizilaeli ivija kama mlohozi wa wanhu wose. Luka kandika kua Yesu kakemigwa na Muhe wa Mndewa,”kuwaligulila Usenga unogile vikumbi muyega,” na Usenga uno Unogile wiza kwa mbuli ya wanhu wose weli na vitangula hakwe hakwe. Mbuli ya deng'o najo dilagusigwa mui Luka, yandikigwa ng'hani haulongozi mwa mzisula zilongole zisimulila mbuli ya kwiza kwa Yesu, na ivija mchikomelezo, haja viyabwelile kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Simo za kukula na kwenela kwa Ukilisito mchipindi cha Yesu zisimuliligwa na munhu iija mchitabu cha Sang'hano za Wasenga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hanhu ha 2 na 6 lola ufambulo ulihasi umema vinhu vingi kulawa mu Usenga Unogile, kama vija simulizi za nyila za Watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu na wasusilaji wa bung'hukilalo viwavikile haja hayavumbuke Yesu, na Yesu Muikae ya Mulungu viyakalile mbwanga, na mifano ya Msamalia yeli na bazi na Mbwanga yagile. Mala zose mgangamizo mkulu wa Usenga uno Unogile uzama kwa kumpula Mulungu, muu Muhe wa Mulungu na kuilava kwa wanachike muisang'hano ya Yesu, na kulekesigwa malozo kulawa kwa Mulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Go mkulu Teofilo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">kwa vija wanhu wengi waiyoha kwandika mbuli zilawilile mmwetu, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />wazandika kama vichisimuliligwe na waja wazionile mbuli izo, na watumigwa wa mbuli ino. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Na niye vinilolile goya chila chinhu kulawila haichanduso, niona vinoga nikwandikile mbuli izo kama viilondeka gweye go mkulu Teofilo. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Nosang'hana gano ili udahe kuumanya ukweli kwa gaja gaufundigwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Ibatizi kolagusigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Muusimo wa Helode mfaume wa Uyahudi hakala na mlava nhambiko imwe zina jake Zakalia, yakalile walukolo wa walava nhambiko wa Abiya. Zina da mwehe wake kokemigwa Elizabeti, iyo nayo kolawa mulukolowa walava nhambiko. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Na wose waidi weli na nhogolwa kwa Mulungu, wagendelela kuzigoga ndagizi na malagizo gose ga Mndewa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Mbali wakala bule wana, kwa vija Elizabeti kakala mgumba, kwa vija wose waidi wakala wavele ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Mdizua dimwe Zakalia kakala yolava nhambiko Muikae ya Mulungu na ikala iyo zamu yake. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Kama viikalile jadi yao kwa walava nhambiko, simbi imgwila Zakalia kwingila muikae ya Mndewa Mulungu kuvukiza ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Na chipindi cha kuvukiza ubani vichivikile, waja wose waikunzanye hamwe kumfugamila Mulungu wakala hanze wopula. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, kamlawila ubanzi wa kulume wa chilemela cha kuvukizila ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakalia viyamonile kasinhuka na kagwa kigudemo. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Mbali mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kamlongela, “Sekeudumbe Zakalia, manake Mulungu kahulika pulo jako, mwehe wako Elizabeti kokulelela mwana wa chilume. nagweye komkema zina jake Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Kwa vija kokwing'ha ndeng'helelo na kudeng'ha, nawo wanhu wengi vija vonda wadeng'helele kwa mbuli ya uvumbuka wake. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Kwa vija kokua mkulu ha Mndewa. Hong'wa mbe divai hebu upele. Nayo kobokela udaho kwa Muhe wa Mulungu kabula hanavumbuka, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />nayo kowadahiza wanhu wengi Waizilaeli kubwela kwa Mulungu wao. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nayo kolongola kabula ya Mndewa, muu muhe na udaho wa Eliya. Koihindula mioyo ya watata kuwatonga wana wao, kowatenda waja wadulu wamtogole Mndewa, naivo komtandila Mndewa wanhu wake.’'<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakalia kamuuza mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, “Yodahikaze mbuli iyo? Manake niye namvele ng'hani, na mwehe wangu ivija mlala ng'hani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kedika, “Niye iyo Gabilieli, nikwima ha Mulungu, nitumigwa kumwako kukulongela Usenga uno Unogile.” <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kwa vija huzitogole mbuli zangu zinikulongele, kulawa sambi, kokua na ludanha mbaka chipindi icho mbuli zino vonda zilawilile.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Chipindi icho wanhu wakala wombeta Zakalia kunze kuno wokanganya halopole kulawa Muikae ya Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Viyapotigwa kulonga, wao wavimanya kua kawona bumbuwazi Muikae ya Mulungu. Mbali kwa vija kakala na ludanha, ivo kakala yolonga nao kwa kuwalagusila kwamakono.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Chipindi viyakomleleze kusang'hana Muikae ya Mulungu, kabwela ukae yake. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Vichibitile chipindi chidodo Elizabeti mwehe wake kamela mate, nayo kainega ukae yake kwa miezi mitano. Kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Dino ijo Mndewa diyanionile na kunitendela unovu wake niiyeka na kunilavila chinyala changu hawanhu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu kosimuligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Muumwezi wa sita wa inda ya Elizabeti, mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu katumigwa na Mndewa Mulungu kuita mbaka kae ya Galilaya, zina jake Nazaleti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwa mhambe yafungile pamvu na munhu imwe zina jake Yusufu wa kae ya Daudi. Zina da ino mhambe iyo Malia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Nayo mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu keza kumwake kamlamsa kamlongela, “Mndewa ka hamwe na gweye, gweye wing'higwe unovu na Mndewa!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Nayo Malia kagazika ng'hani mmoyo kwa mbuli zino, ndamso ino yavilihi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Baho mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kamlongela, “Malia sekeudumbe, gweye kupata ng'hekewa ya Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kwavija kopata inda na kulela mwana wa chilume na komkema zina jake Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nayo kokuwa na Undewa, ivija kokemigwa Mwana wa yeli Kuchanha ng'hani. Mndewa Mulungu komwing'ha Ufaume kama Tata yake Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />koilongoza ulelo wa Yakobo halibule uhelelo, na ufaume wake wabule uhelelo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia kammwidika mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kamlongela, “Niye na mhambe, mbuli ino yodahikaze?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kamwidika, “Muhe wa Mulungu kokwizila, na udaho wake yeli kuchanha ng'hani zokugubika kama sisila, kwa ivo iyo yavumbuke kwa mbuli ya Mulungu kokemigwa Mwana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Lola, walukolo wako Elizabeti iyo yakemigwe mgumba, sambi kamela mate muuvele wake na uno uwo mwezi wake wa sita. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Manake kwa Mulungu habule mbuli ipotigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Malia kalonga, “Lola, niye iyo mtumigwa wa Mndewa ivo ikale kumwangu kama vuulongile.”<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malia kaita kumtembelela Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mumsimo uwo Malia kalopola kuita kui kae imwe mvigongo va isi ya Uyahudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Kengila muikae ya Zakalia, na kumlamsa Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Nayo Elizabeti viyahulike ndamusi ya Malia, mwana yakalile mmunda mwake kazumha. Elizabeti kabokela udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />kenula dizi kulu kalonga, “Kwing'higwa unovu na Mulungu gweye kubita wamwenga mwa wake wose, nayo mwanago yonda umulele kabalikigwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Habali niye ning'higwe ng'hekewa ng'hulu, mbaka mami ya Mndewa wangu yavike kumwangu? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Bahaja vinihulike ndamso yako, mwana yeli mmunda mwangu kazumha na kudeng'helela. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kana unovu wa Mulungu iyo yatogole kua dija Mndewa diyamlongele gosang'hanika!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malia kokwimba wila wakumtogola Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Nayo Malia kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Moyo wangu womtogola Mndewa,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />nodeng'helela kwambuli ya Mulungu mlohozi wangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />kwa vija hanisemwile mtumigwa wake mtumbala mavindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">manake kulawa sambi ulelo wose wong'hema ning'higwe unovu na Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Manake iyo yeli na udaho kanhendela mbuli ya uzonza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Zina jake yaiyeka dinang'hane ng'hane.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ubazi wa Mulungu wowawinza waja wose wamtogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">kulawa ulelo mbaka ulelo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Kwa vija katenda mbuli ng'hulu kwa udaho wake, na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">kapwililisa nhonga za weli na udulu mmioyo yao.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Kawahulumusa wafaume kulawa muulongozi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">mbali kawenula waja wotumbala.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Kaweng'ha nzama weli na nzala vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">mbali wazenzi kawasegeza bila chinhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kamtaza mtumigwa wake Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">viyakumbuke lagano jake da kumonela bazi.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Kama viyawalalike Tata zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Ibulahimu na ulelo wake bila uhelelo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia kakala kwa miezi midatu vino na Elizabeti, amala kabwela ukae yake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Elizabeti viyavikize chipindi cha kuibasula, kalela mwana wa chilume. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Mbwiga na walukolo wake viwahulika vija Mndewa Mulungu viyamtendele unovu mkulu, nao wadeng'helela hamwe nayo.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwana viyavikize zua da nane weza kumwingiza kumbi, walonda ija mwana yakemigwe Zakalia, zina da tati yake. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Mbali mami yake hatogole, na kalonga, “Habule! Zina jake kokemigwa Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Wayage wamlongela, “Mulukolo lwako habule munhu yoyose yeli na zina kama ijo!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Baho wamwing'ha vilaguso Zakalia tati yake ili wavimanye kua mwenyego kolonda kumwing'ha zina gani.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakalia kapula wamwing' he chibao chakwandikila, “Kandika zina jake Yohana.” Wose wakanganya! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Bahaja ludanha umlawa na lulimi lwake ulekesigwa, kandusa kulonga kuno komtogola Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Wanhu welibehi nayo wamkanganya Mulungu na Muuisi yose na mvigongo vose va isi ya Uyahudi wanhu wandusa kusimulila mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Chila munhu viyahulike mbuli zino kakanganyika na kauza, “Che, mwana ino kokua munhu wa vilihi?” Manake udaho wa Mndewa Mulungu ukala hamwe nayo.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulagusi wa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Nayo Zakalia tataake imwana, kabokela udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, kalagusa ga Mulungu Usenga ulawa kwa Mulungu, kalonga,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Yatogoligwe Mndewa, Mulungu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">kwavija kawezila wanhu wake na kuwalohola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Nayo kaching'ha mlohozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">muulelo wa Daudi mtumigwa wake.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Kama viyalongile kubitila milomo ya walagusi wa Mulungu yawabagule kwa mbuli yake baho umwaka,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kua kochihonya kulawa kwa wahasanyi wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kulawa mmakono ga waja wochihila,<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />ili kulagusa unovu kwa tata zetu, na seke yaisemwe Lagano jake dinang'hane ng'hani,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />laliko kama diyamlalike tata yetu Abulahamu kwa kuilahila,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />kochihonya kulawa mmakono ga wahasanyi zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">kochidahiza kumsang'hanila bila kudumba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kwa kukala ubanzi wake na kutogoligwa kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">mmazua gose ga ugima wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nagweye mwanangu, kokemigwa Mlagusi wa Mulungu yeli hachanha ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">kwavija komulongolela Mndewa na kumtandila nzila kwa mbuli yake,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />kuwalongela wanhu wake kua woloholigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kubitila kwa kulekeseligwa malozo gao.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kwa mbuli ya uhole na ubazi wa Mulungu wetu, na bung'hulo da ulohozi wake wochibung'hulila kulawa kuchanha.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />ili uwabung'hulile waja wose wokala mdiziza na wagubikigwe na ziza da ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kulongoza magulu getu muinzila ya utindiwala.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana ija kakula na kongezeka udaho muu muhe. Kakala kuluwala mbaka zua dija diyailaguse kwa wanhu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Msimo uja Agusto Mfaume wa Loma kalagiza wanhu wose wa ufaume wa Loma wapetigwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ino ikala mala ya mosi ya kwandikigwa mazina ga wanhu chipindi chija Kilenio viyakalile Liwali wa Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Wanhu wose waita kwandikigwa, chila munhu kaita kwandikigwa kuikae yake iyaleligwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu nayo kalawa kae ya Nazaleti ili Galilaya, kuita, Betelehemu muikae Yudea kae ya Daudi, Yusufu kaita uko kwavija yeye wa lukolo wa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Kaita uko ili yandikigwe hamwe na Maliamu mwehe yamlavile pamvu nayo kakala na inda, <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />ivo, viwakalile uko Betelehemu, mazua gake kuibasula chimvikila. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Kamlela mwanage wachilume wa chaudele na kamvaza vikumbi, kamtambaliza mdidogo disongoligwe da kudila ng'ombe kwavija hawapatile hanhu hakuwasa mzikae za wageni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wowalawila wasusilaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Hakala na wasusilaji wakalile wokala behi na baho, wakala wokwamila bung'hukilalo zao ichilo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Bahaja Mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kawalawila, na bung'hulo da Mulungu uwabung'hulila ubanzi wose, nao wengila na gudemo kulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Mbali mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kawalongela, “Sekemdumbe! Kwa vija nie niwagalila Usenga unogile yonda iweng'he ndeng'helo ng'hulu kwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kwavija lelo muikae ya Daudi kaleligwa mlohozi kwa mbuli yenu, iyo Kilisito Mndewa! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na vino vokua vilaguso kumwenu, momvika mwana kavazigwa vikumbi, kawasa mdigogo disongoligwe kwa kudila ng'ombe.<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Bahaja walawila bumbila kulu da watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, wailumba na mtumigwa miyao, wamtogola Mulungu wolonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Yatogoligwe Mulungu yeli kuchanha kuulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na muiisi kukale na utindawala kwa wanhu yeli na lazi nao.<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Viwasegele waja watumigwa kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu, waja wasusilaji wailongela, “Haya na chiteni mbaka Beselehemu, chikalole gaja galawilile, mbuli ziyachilongele Mndewa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Walopola kuita Betelehemu wamvika Maliamu na Yusufu na ija mwana ching'hele katambalalizwa mdigogo disongoligwe da kulisila ng'ombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Viwamonile imwana, wapwililisa gaja gawalongiligwe na mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kwa mbuli ya mwana io. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Wose wahulike wakanganyika ng'hani kwa gaja gawalongiligwe na wasusilaji wa ngh‘ondolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mbali Maliamu kazika mmoyo mbuli zose na kuzitonga. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Amala waja wasusilaji wabwela kuchiwala, kuno womwing'ha ukulu Mulungu na kumtogola kwa gaja gawahulike na kugaona, kama viwalongeligwe Mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana keng'higwa zina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Na vidivikile zua da nane mwana kengizigwa kumbi, na kwing'higwa zina da Yesu, zina diyeng'higwe na mtumigwa wa kuulanga kabula Malia hanapata inda.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagaligwa Muikae ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Amala, chipindi cha kusunhigwa vizimalile ka Maliamu, kama viikalile ndagizi ya Musa, Yusufu na Maliamu wamgala mwana Yelusalemu, ili asimikigwe kwa Mndewa, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />kama viyandikigwe muindagizi ya Mndewa, “Chila mwana wa chilume wa chaudele yasimikigwe kwa Mndewa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Nao ivija wakalave nhosa ya kulunguza, kama viilagizigwe muindagizi ya Mndewa, hua waidi hebu mang'inda maidi ga njiwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Muikae ya Yelusalemu hakala na munhu imwe zina jake Simeoni, nayo ni munhu yatogoligwe kwa Mulungu, yomfugamila Mulungu, yokalizila kuloholigwa kwa Waizilaeli na Muhe wa Mulungu ukala nayo <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />nayo kagangamiziligwa na Muhe wa Mulungu kua hopata ifa mbaka yamone Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mndewa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ivo kuno kolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu, Simeoni kengila Haikae ya Mulungu, na tata na mami yake Yesu wamgala mwana Haikae ya Mulungu, wamtendele kama viwazowele mzindagizi zao, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeoni kamsola mwana mmakono gake kuno komtogola Mulungu, kalonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Mndewa, sambi kodaha kumleka mtumigwa wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">yage kwa utindiwala, kama vuunilalike.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwavija niuona ulohozi wako kwa meso gangu mwenyego,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />uutandile goya mmeso ga wanhu wose,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />diwe bung'hulo kwa kuwabung'hulila wanhu waja sio Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na Ukulu wa Mulungu kwa wanhu wako Wazilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Na tata na mami yake wakala wakanganyigwe ng'hani kwa gaja galongigwe kwa mbuli yake. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ivo Simeoni kawapulila kwa Mulungu yaweng'he ganogile, na kumlongela Maliamu mami yake Yesu, “Mwana ino kekigwa giladi kwa mbuli ya kwaga na kuloholigwa kwa wanhu wengi muiisi ya Waizilaeli. Iyo kokua kilaguso kulawa kwa Mulungu yonda ilemigwe na wanhu wengi. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Na ivo nhonga za wanhu wengi zooneka hazelu na gweye mwenyego, kopata giogio ng'hani.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Hakala na muke imwe mgane, mlagusi wa Mulungu zina jake Ana biti Fanueli, lukolo lwake lwa Asheli, kakala mvele na ivija kakala na mulume wake milao saba tu kulawa viyafungile zengele. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Amala kakala chizuka kwa milao samanini na mine, halawile Haikae ya Mulungu mazua gose, kuno komfugamila Mulungu kokala bila kuja kuno yompula Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Bahaja Ana kalawilila haulongozi ha Yusufu na Malia na kasonga kumtogola na kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu na kulonga mbuli ya mwana iyo kwa wanhu wose wokalile wobeta ulohozi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu na Malia wobwela Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusufu na Malia viwakomeleze kusang'hana gose galagizigwe na ndagizi ya Mndewa Mulungu, wabwela muikae yao ya Nazaleti uko Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Nayo mwana Yesu kakula yokongezeka ludabwa, nzewele na unovu wa Mulungu ukala nayo.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Haikae ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Ivo chila mlao Yusufu na Malia Mami yake wakala woita Yelusalemu mumsimo wa lusona lwa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu viyavikize ukulu wa milao kumi na midi, walawa kuita mulusona lwa Pasaka kama viwazowele. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Pasaka viimalile, haja Yusufu na Malia viwakalile wobwela ukae, Yesu yeye kasigala Yelusalemu mbali wao hawavimanyile. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Yusufu na Malia wavimanya kaumo muumwanza na wamwenga, wagenda mwanza mbaka hadiswele zua. Leka wandusa kumzambwila kwa wenekae wao na kwa mbwiga zake. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Viwamhonyile wabwela Yelusalemu ili kumzambwila uko. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Mdizua dakadatu ivo viwamonile, wamvika Haikae ya Mulungu, kakala yakalile hagati yao wafunza ndagizi, kowategeleza na kuwauza mbuli. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Wose wamuhulike wakanganyika ng'hani na udaho wake mkulu wa umanyi na kufambula goya mbuli ziyauzigwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Yusufu na Malia viwamonile wakanganya ng'hani. Malia, mami yake kamuuza, “Mwanangu, mbona kuchitendela vino? Lola nie na tataako chikala chokuzambwila kila hanhu kwa kugwaya.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu kawauza, “Habali mnizambwile? Hamvimanyile nilondeka kukala Haikae ya Tata angu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Mbali wao hawadimanyile dija diyawalongele.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Labaho kaita nao mbaka Nazaleti, nayo kakala yowategeleza. Mbali mami yake kazika mmoyo wake mbuli zino zose. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Nayo Yesu kakala yokula kwa chimo na nzewele kuno yomnogela Mulungu na Wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizi kowaligulila wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Muumlao wa kumi na tano wa Ufaume wa Kaizali Tibelio, wa Pontio Pilato yakalile mkuluisi wa Yudea, Helode kakala mkulu wa Galilaya, na walukolo wake Filipo kakala mkulu wa hanhu ha Itulea na Tlakoniti. Lusania kakala mkulu wa Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Anasi na Kayafa wakala walava nhambiko wakulu. Chipindi icho usenga wa Mulungu umwizila Yohana mwanage Zakalia, kuja kuchiwala. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohana Mbatizi kavika muisi yose ili habehi na lwanda lwa Yolodani kuno yoligula kwa wanhu, “Lekeni malozo na mbatizigwe na Mulungu kowalekesela malozo genu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kama viyandikigwe mchitabu cha Mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Dizi da munhu yoguta mchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Muike goya nzila ya Mndewa, goloseni hayabitila!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />chila zanda dosilizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">chila lugongo na chigogo hosilizigwa goya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Nzila zikalile vihile zogolosigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">start with capital: qikwatuligwe zosindiligwa goya.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na wanhu wose wouona ulohozi wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana kadilongela dija bumbila da wanhu wakalile wokwiza kubatizigwa nayo, “Mweye ulelo wa nyoka! Yelihi yawalongele mkimbile ludoko wonda wize? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Laguseni kwa sang'hano kua mleka malozo. Sambi sekemuigode kulonga, ‘Tata yetu Ibulahimu!’ Nowalongeleni kweli, Mulungu kodaha kugatenda mabwe gano gawe wanage Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ivo shoka ya mmakono kukanha masina ga mibiki, chila mbiki ulemile kulela manhunda ganogile wokahnigwa na kwasigwa mmoto.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Dija bumbila da wanhu dimuuza, “Cholondeka chitente choni?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohana kawalongela, “Yeli na migolole midi yamwing'he yelibule, yeli na ndia yatende ivo.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Ivija wagoga kodi weza wabatizigwe, wamuuza, ‘‘Mfundaji, na cheye chitendeze?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Kawalongela,”sekemgoge kodi kubita chija chimlondeke.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nao wamilizi wamuuza, “Cheye cholondeka chisang'hane choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Kawalongela, “Sekemboke vinhu va munhu yoyose kwaludabwa mlinao hebu kumgala munhu mchitala kwa uvwizi. Ivo mwigute na vitumetume venu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Nhonga za wanhu zisonga kongezeka, na wakanganya wagiza Yohana kodaha kua iyo Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mndewa. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohana kawedikila kawalongela, “Nie nowabatiza kwa mazi, kokwiza yeli na udaho kubita niye iyo sidaha kupumbulula nzabi za mikwabazi yake. Iyo kowabatiza kwa muhe wa Mulungu na moto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Lungo wake wa mmakono, wa kubetela uhemba wake nayo kofagila lubuga lwake lwa kukunzanyila uhemba kudigulu, mbali mikupi yokunzanyigwa na kusomigwa kwa moto uwo haudaha kufa.’' <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ivo, kwa malakilo gamwenga mengi, Yohana kawakomhokela wanhu viyakalile kowaligulila wanhu Usenga unogile. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Mbali, Mfaume Helode viyakomhokeligwe na Yohana kwa mbuli ya kumsola Helodia, mwehe wa walukolo wake, na ubananzi wose yautendile Helode. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Helode kagangamiza ubananzi na kumgela Yohana mdigeleza.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Wanhu wose viwakalile wobatizgwa, na Yesu nayo kabatizigwa, na viyakalile yopula ulanga ugubuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Muhe wa Mulungu kamhulumukila kwa lumbo da hua, na dizi kulawa kuulanga ihulikigwa, ‘'Gweye iyo mwanagu wa wende, ninogeligwe ng'hani na gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu kakala na ukulu wa milao salasini viyasongile san'no zake.Wakala womgesa kua iyo mwanage Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />na Eli kakala mwanage Matati, na Matati kakala mwanage Lawi, na Lawi kakala mwanage Meliki, na Meleki kakala mwanage Yanai, na Yanai kakala mwanage Yosefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu kakala mwanage Matatia, Matatia kakala mwanage Amosi, Amosi kakal mwanage Nahumu, Nahumu kakala mwanage Esili, Esili kakala mwanage Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai kakala mwanage Maati, Maati kakala mwanage Matatia, Matatia kakala mwanage Semeini, Semeini kakala mwanage Yoseki, Yoseki kakala mwanage Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda kakala mwanage Yoanani, Yoanani kakala mwanage Lesa, Lesa kakala mwanage Zalubabeli, Zalubabeli kakala mwanage Sheatieli, Sheatieli kakala mwanage Neli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli kakala mwanage Meliki, Meliki kakala mwanage Adi, na Adi kakala mwanage Kosamu, Kosamu kakala mwanage Elimadamu, Elimadamu kakala mwanage Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eli kakala mwanage Yoshua,Yoshua kakala mwanage Yolimu, Yolimu kakala mwanage Matati, na Matati kakala mwanage Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi kakala mwana wa Simeoni, na Simeoni kakala mwanage Yuda, na Yuda kakala mwanage Yusufu kakala mwanage Yolamu, Yolamu, kakala mwanage Eliakimu, Eliakimu kakala mwanage Melea, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakimu kakala mwanage Melea na Melea kakala mwanage Mena, wa Matata, Matata kakala mwanage Nathani, kakala mwanage Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daudi kakala mwanage Yese,na Yese kakala mwanage Obedi, na Obedi kakala mwanage Boazi, na Boziazi kakala mwanage Salumoni na Salumoni kakala mwanage Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni kakala mwanage Aminadabu na Aminadabu kakala mwanage Alamu, na Alamu kakala mwanage Hesiloni, Hesiloni kakala mwanage Pelesi, Pelesi kakala Mwanage Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda kakala mwanage Yakobo, Yakobo kakala mwanage Isaka, kakala mwanage Abulahimu, Abulahamu kakala mwanage Tela, Tela kakala mwanage Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naholi kakala mwage Selugi, Selugi kakala mwanage Lubeni, Lubeni kakala mwanage Pelegi, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Pelegi kakala mwanage Ebeli kakala mwanage Sala kakala mwana wa Kenani, kakala mwanage Alufakisadi, Alufakisadi kakalawa Shemu, Shemu kakala mwanage Nuhu, Nuhu kakala mwanage Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki kakala mwanage Metusela, Metusela kakala mwanage Enoki, kakala mwanage Yaledi, kakala mwanage Mahalaleli, Mahalaleli mwanage Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenani kakala mwanage Enoshi, Enoshi kakala mwanage Seti, Seti kakala mwanage Adamu, Adamu kakala mwana wa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Maluko 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu viyeli na udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, kabwela kulawa Yolodani yolongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu mbaka kuchiwala, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />uko kagezigwa na Mwenembago kwa mazua alubaini. Mchipindi icho chose hadile chochose, mazua vigabitile kaona nzala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ivo Mwenembago kamlongela, “Gweye wahawa mwana wa Mulungu, dilongele dibwe dino digeluke gate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu kamwidika kamlongela, “Yandikigwa, ‘Munhu hokala kwa kuja gate diyeka.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Labaho Mwenembago kamsola mbaka kuchanha ng'hani kulugongo na kamlagusila ufaume wose wa muuisi kwamala lumwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Labaho iyo Mwenembago kamlongela,’‘Nokwing'ha udaho kwa mbuli ya ufaume na Undewa uno na unovu wake, kwa vija ning'higwa vino vose, na ivo nodaha kumwing'ha yoyose kama vinilonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ivo wahanifugamila, vinhu vose vokua vako.’' <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu kamwidika kamlongela, “Yandikgwa, ‘Mfugamile Mndewa Mulungu wako nakumsan'ganila iyo yaiyeka!’“ <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Amala Mwenembago kamgala mbaka Yelusalemu, kamwika kuchiswili mwa kae ya Mulungu, kamlongela “Gweye wahawa iyo mwana wa Mulungu, ibwanhe hasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Manake yandikigwa mmayandiko, ‘Mulungu kowalagiza watumigwa wake wa kuulanga wakukimile.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Na ivija yandikigwa, ‘Mulungu kokutumila Watumigwa wa Kuulanga wokudanhe mmakono gao sekeuikwale mgulu wako mdibwe.” <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Mbali Yesu kamwidika, “Ivija yandikigwa, ‘Sekeumgeze Mndewa Mulungu wako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Mwenembago viyakomeleze kumgeza chila chinhu, baho kamuleka Yesu chidogo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kasonga sang'hano zake Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Maluko 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Labaho Yesu kabwela yeli na udaho wa Muhe wa Mulungu, nambuli zake zenela Galilaya na mziisi zilibehi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nayo kakala yowafunda wanhu mzikae za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, na chila munhu kamtogola.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalemigwa Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Amala Yesu Kaita Nazaleti, haja hayaleligwe, na Mdizua da kuhumula Wayahudi, kaita haja hanhu hakuiting'hanila Wayahudi kama viikalile jadi yake. Baho kema yasome mayandiko <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />nayo keng'higwa chitabu cha Mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya, kachipumbulula kavika hanhu handikigwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Muhe wa Mndewa univala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kwa vija kanibagula kuwagalila vikumbimuyega Usenga unogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Kanilagiza kuwatangazila wafungigwe kulekesigwa kwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na waja vipofu walole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">nawaja wadununzigwe wailegehe.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />nakuwatangazila mlao wa Mndewa utogoligwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">wa Mndewa Mulungu kuwalohola wanhu wake.’'<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Labaho Yesu kazingiliza chitabu, kambwezela mtumigwa amala kakala. Na wanu wose wakalile haja Muikae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi wambunhulila meso, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />baho kasonga kuwalongela, “Lelo mayandiko gano gawavikila, kama vumhulike vinisomile.’' <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Wose wakalile baho wamtogola na wakanganya mbuli zake zenele nzewele waiuza, ‘'Che!, ino sio mwanage Yosefu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu kawalongela, ‘‘Nivimanya monongela ulonzi kunizeha, ‘Mlaguzi ilagule mwenyego.’ Amala zija mbuli zichihulike kuzisang'hana Kapelenaumu zisang'hane ivija na hano ukae yako. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yesu kalonga, Togoleni nowalongela, habule “Mlagusi wa Mulungu yotogoligwa muikae yake mwenyego. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Nhegelezeni nowalongela, hakala na wagane wengi muiisi ya Izilaeli msimo wa Eliya, ulanga ufungigwa na mvula ileka kutoa kwa milao midatu na miezi sita baho hakala na bung'hukila ya nzala muisi yose. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Mbali Mulungu hamtumile Eliya kwa chila munhu yakalile baho Izilaeli, mbali kwa ija mgane wa Salepati muiisi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Ivija hakala na wanhu wengi muiisi ya Izilaeli weli na utamu wa dikulu, chipindi cha Mlagusi wa Mulungu Elisha, mbali habule hata imwe yahonyigwe, ila Naamani munhu wa Shamu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Wanhu wose wakalile Muikae ya hakuiting'hanila Wayahudi viwahulike mbuli zino wagevuzika ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Wema na wamkwekwesa kunze ya kae yao, wamsola mbaka kuchanha kuchigongo hanhu hakalile hazengigwe kae iyo, ili wamwase mdikombo kulawa kuchanha kuchigongo, <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />mbali Yesu kabita hagati yao kaita.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlava Munhu Chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maluko 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Amala Yesu kaita Kapelenaumu muikae ya Galilaya, kakala yowafunda wanhu Mdizua da Kuhumula. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Wakanganyika ng'hani viyakalile yofunda, kwa vija kakala yolonga kwa udaho. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mja mgati ha Kae ya hakuiting'hanila Wayahudi hakala na munhu imwe yambule kinyamkela, kakala yoguta kwa dizi kulu kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Gweye Yesu wa Nazaleti kuna choni na cheye? Ivo, kwiza kuchibananga? Nikumanya gweye kwa nani. Gweye iyo ubaguligwe kwa mbuli ya Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu kamlakila ija kinyamkela, kalonga “Nyamala hupi mlekese munhu ino!” Mbali ija Chinyamkela viyambwanhile hasi munhu ija haulongozi ha wanhu wose, kamlekesa bila kumlumiza hata chidogo.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Wanhu wose wakanganya waiuza, “Dino davilihi“? Kwa ukulu na udaho kowalongela vinyamkela walawe nao wolawa!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ivo mbuli za Yesu zenela chila hanhu muiisi ija.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu kalawa Haikae ya hakuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kwingila muikae ya Simoni. Nayo kamvika mkoi wake Simoni kakala na mawine makali ng'hali, nawo wampula Yesu yamhonye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Baho Yesu kamwinamila na kukomhokela mawine gaja nayo imleka, na bahaja kalamka na kuwasang'hanila.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Vidiswele zua, wanhu wose wakalile na vitamu wawagala kumwake, nayo keka makono gake kwa chila mtamu na kuwahonya. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Vinyamkela ivija wawalekesa wanhu wengi, na viwakalile wolawa watoa nyangi na kulonga, “Gweye iyo mwanage Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Mbali Yesu kawalakila na kuwagoma sekewalonge, kwa vija wakala wammanya kua iyo Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mndewa.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofunda Usenga unogile uko Yudea</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maluko 1:35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Igolo yake lukwili Yesu kaita hanhu kaibanga. Wanhu wakala womzambwila chila hanhu, na viwamonile, wageza kumgoma seke yasegele kumwao. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Mbali nayo kawalongela, “Nolondeka kufunda Usenga unogile wa Ufaume wa Mulungu Mzikae zimwenga ivija, manake nitumigwa kwa sang'hano iyo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Nayo kagendelela kufunda haja Mzikae za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi uko Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowabagula waluko wa mosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile kema habehi na Lwanda lwa Genezaleti, wanhu wengi wammemela wamsung'hasung'ha wahulike mbuli ya Usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Kaziona ngalawa mbili hamgwazo ha ulwanda, zilekigwa baho na wavula somba wakalile wohambulahambula na kusonelela nyavu zao. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu viyeingile mgati ya ija ngalawa imwe ikalile ya Simoni, kampula yeikwese mgamazi hamwande chidogo kulawa mhwani. Amala kakala hasi na kufunda wanhu yeli muingalawa. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Viyakomeleze kufunda, kamlongela Simoni, “Sambi sung'heni ngalawa muigale kuing'huta mvule somba. <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni kamwidika kalonga, “Go Mndewa, cheye chisang'hana sang'hano ichilo chose hachipatile chinhu, mbali kwa ulonzi wako, noutanda lwavu mmazi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nao viwazitandile nyavu izo, wavula somba wengi ng'hani mbaka nyavu zimema na zisonga kudegeka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ivo wawahungila makono kuwakema wayao wakalile muingalawa imwenga weze kuwataza. Nao weza wamemeza somba mzi ngalawa zose mbili zikala behi kudidimila. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petulo viyaonile gaja galawilile, kafugama mafindi haulongozi ha Yesu kalonga, “Go Mndewa segela hamwangu kwa vija niye nna malozo!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na wayage wose wazaganyika ng'hani kuvula somba wengi wengi <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ivija Yakobo na Yohana na wanage Zebedayo, wakalile wavula somba wayage Simoni. Baho Yesu kamlongela Simoni, “Sekeudumbe, kulawa sambi hua mvula somba, mbali kowalagala wanhu Kumwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Viwakomeleze kuzivikiza mhwani ngalawa zao, waleka vose na wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yeli na dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ikala zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile hanhu hamwenga, munhu imwe yeli na dikulu lukuli wose. Viyamonile Yesu katumbala mavindi kainamila hasi kampula Yesu kalonga, “Go Mndewa wahalonda kodaha kunihonya ili nidahe kumfugamila Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu kagolosa makono gake, kamwamha kalonga, “Nolonda, uhone!” Bahaja munhu ija kahona utamu wa dikulu na nipata nyafasi ya kumtogola Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Nayo Yesu kamgoma kalonga, “Sekeumulongele munhu yoyose, mbali uite ukailaguse kwa mkulu wa nhambiko, na kalave nhosa ya kulukuza, kama viyalagize Musa kuwagangamizila kua kuhona na kutogoligwa kumwangu na kumfugamila Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Mbali mbuli za iyo Yesu zikala zenela chila hanhu, Mabumbila makulu ga wanhu gakala goiting'hanila kwiza kumtegeleza na kuhonyigwa vitamu vao. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Hata ivo nayo kainega hanhu halibule wanhu, kaita kumpula Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yaholole lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile yofunda, mafalisayo na wafundaji wa ndagizi, walawile mzikae za Galilaya na kulawa Muuyahudi na Yelusalemu, wakala uko. Na udaho wa Mndewa ukala nayo yadahe kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ivija weza wanhu fulani wampapa mdikomwa mtamu imwe yaholole lukuli lwake. Wageza kumwingiza muing'anda na kumwika haulongozi ha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Mbali viwapotigwe kupata nzila ya kumwingiza muing'anda kwa dija bumbila kulu da wanhu, ivo wakwela kuchanha kuchiswili, watobola hanhu hayalile Yesu wapate nyafasi ya kumhulumusa imtamu na komwa jake haulongozi ha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu viyaonile nhogoli yao, kamlongela mtamu ija, “Mbwiga, malozo gako galekesigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Mafalisayo na waja wafundaji wa ndagizi wasonga kuiuza wenyego, “Yelihi ino yomzeha Mulungu? Habule munhu yonda yalekese malozo mbali Mulungu yaiyeka!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu kavimanya viwatonga kawauza, “Habali mogatonga gano mmoyo? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Dilihi dibuhile kumwenu? Niye kulonga, ‘Kulekeseligwa malozogako, hebu kulonga, Ima uite?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Baho molondeka mvimanye kua Mwana wa Munhu kana udaho wa kulekesa malozo ga wanhu muiisi.” Ivo kamlongela ija yaholole lukuli, “Nokulongela, ima upape komwa jako uite ukae yako.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ija munhu yakalile yaholole lukuli kema bahaja hawali wanhu wose, kasola komwa jake diyagonele kaita ukae yake, kuno yomtogola Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Wanhu wose wakanganyika na kugwaya! Na wamwing'ha Mulungu nhogolwa walonga, “Lelo chiuona uzonza!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Yesu viyakomeleze gago kalawa kunze, kamwona munhu imwe yokemigwa Lawi kakala hanhu hake hakugogela kodi, Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Baho Lawi kema na kaleka chila chinhu na kamuwinza. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Amala Lawi kamtandila Yesu galigali ukae yake, na dija bumbila kulu da wagoga kodi na wanhu wamwenga wakala woja hamwe nawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Mbali Mafalisayo na wafundaji wa ndagizi wawanung'hunikila waluko wa Yesu, wauza, “Habali moja na kung'wa hamwe na wagoga kodi na weli na malozo?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu kedika kawalongela, “Weli na ugima hawalonda mlaguzi, mbali weli na vitamu. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Sizile kuwakema wanhu weli na nhogoli, mbali weli na malozo wagaleke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga kuja ndia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Wanhu wamwenga wamlongela Yesu, “Waluko wa Yahana na waja wa Mafalisayo wofunga na kumpula Mulungu mala zose, mbali waluko wako wawo woja na kung'wa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Mbali Yesu kawauza, “Modahaze kuwalongela wanhu wagonekigwe mdizengele waleke kuja na wahamwe na mfunga zengele? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Mbali chipindi chovika mfunga zengele yahasegezigwa kumwao, ivo wonda wafunge.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu kaweng'ha ulonzi uno, kalonga, “Habule munhu yonda yasole chilaka cha sambi yasonele mchivalo cha mwaka, yahatenda ivo, kokua kabananga kwa vija haviigala. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Ivija habule munhu yonda yagele divai ya sambi mmifuko ya mbende ya mwaka, mbali yahagela umo ija divaiya sambi mmifuko ya mbende ya mwaka yobanangika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Divai ya sambi uwo wogeligwa mmifuko ya sambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Habule munhu yonda yang'we divai ya sambi yahandusa divai ya mwaka, kolonga, ‘Ija yamwaka unoga ng'hani.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo Mndewa wa zua da kuhumula da Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Mdizua dimwe da kuhumula da Wayahudi Yesu kakala yobita mmigunda ya uhemba, waluko wake wakala wokwanyula makwamvi ga uhemba, wakala wofigisafigisa mmakono gao woja. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Baho Mafalisayo wamwenga wawauza, “Habali mosang'hana ivo mdizua da kuhumula da Wayahudi?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu kawedika, kawauza “Che, mweye hamsomile dija yadisang'hane Daudi na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Daudi kengila Muikae ya Mulungu, kaisola ija migate ya laguso ijigwa na Walava nhambiko waiyeka, kaja na ivija kaweng'ha wayage waja.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu iyo Mndewa wa zua ijo da kuhumula da Wayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yeli na mkono uholole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Vidivikile zua dimwenga da kuhumula, Yesu kengila muikae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, na kawafunda, baho hakala na munhu imwe yakalile yaholole mkono wake wa kulume. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Mafalisayo na waja wafundaji wa ndagizi wakala womsepa Yesu walole kama komhonya mdizua da kuhumula, amala wapate mbuli ya kumgala mchitala. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Mbali Yesu kaimanya nhonga yao, baho kamlongela munhu ija yeli na mkono uholole, “Ima wize haulongozi ha wanhu.” Bahaja munhu ija kema haulongozi hao wose. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Amala Yesu kawalongela waja wafundaji wa ndagizi na Mafalisayo, kalonga, “Mweye nowauzeni, “Dofaya dilihi mdizua da kuhumula, kusang'hana ganogile hebu gehile? Kulohola ugima wa munhu hebu kuubananga?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Kawabunhulila meso gage mhande zose, kamlongela munhu ija yeli na mkono uholole, “Golosa mkono wako.” Munhu ija kaugolosa mkono wake nao uhona kabisa.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Mbali mafalisayo na waja wafundaji wa ndagizi wagevuzika ng'hani na waiuza wenyego vija viwalonda kumtendela vihile Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosagula watumigwa kumi na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Zua dimwe Yesu kakwela kulugongo kumpula Mulungu, kakala uko meso chilo chose kuno yompula Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Viivikile imitondo kawakema waluko wake, nayo kasagula kumi na waidi mmwao, wao kawakema watumigwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni ija yeng'higwe na Yesu zina dimwenga Petulo, na walukolo wake Andelea na Yakobo na Yohana na Filipo na Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo na Tomasi, Yakobo mwanage Alufayo na Simoni yoigombela isi yake, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yuda mwanage Yakobo, na Yuda Isikaliote, mwaluko yamhinduke Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawahonya wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayo 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu viyahulumuke kulawa kulugongo hamwe na watumigwa wake, kema hanhu halibule lugongo, wanhu wengi ng'hani waikunzanya walawile kuuyahudi na Yelusalem, na mhwani ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Wanhu wose wavika kumtegeleza Yesu na kuhonyigwa vitamu weli navo ivija kawahonya wanhu wakalile wogazigwa na vinyamkela. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Wanhu wose walonda kumwamha Yesu, kwa vija udaho ukala omlawa na uhonya wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Deng'o na giogio</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayo 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu kawalola waja waluko wake, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mmweda mweye vikumbi muyega, kwa vija</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">Ufaume wa Mulungu uwo wenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“Mmweda mweye mlinanzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa vija mokwiza kwiguta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">“Mmweda mweye mlila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa vija mokwiza kuseka!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Mmweda mweye wanhu wahawehila, na kuwabagula na kuwaliga, na kuwalonga vihile kwa mbuli ya Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Na vondagalawilile gago, deng'heni na kuzumhazumha, manake gweko jenu kulu kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Manake wavele wenu wawatendela ivo Walagusi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Mbali moluona mweye mliwazenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwa vija mweye mmweda tiyali!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“Moluona mweye mwigute sambi, manake mokwiza kuona nzala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">“Moluona mweye mseka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">manake mokwiza kulila na kulombokeza!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Moluona mweye wanhu wahawatogola kwavija ivo tata zao viwawatendele waja walagusi wa uvwizi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Weng'heni wende wahasanyi wenu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Mbali nowalongeleni mweye mnitegeleza, weng'heni wende wahasanyi wenu, wasang'hanileni goya waja wose wowenukila, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />wengheni wende waja wose wowaduila, wapulileni waja wowadununza. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mbali munhu yahakutowa kanza da kulume mhindulile na da kumoso ivija. Munhu yahakuboka golole jako mwing'he na umsuli ivija. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Munhu yoyose yokupula chinhu mwing'he, na munhu yokuboka vinhu vako sekeulonde yakubwelezele. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Wawasang'hanileni wamwenga, kama vumlonda wawasang'hanile mweye. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Mbali mwahawatogola waja wowatogola mweye, momweda choni? Weli na malozo ivija nawo wowatogola wayao! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Hebu mwawasang'hanila ganogile waja wowasang'hanila mweye mwopata choni? Hebu weli na malozo wosang'hana ivo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kama mwahawakopesha wanhu kwa tamanilo da kumbwezeligwa, momweda choni? Hata weli na malozo woikopa na wotamanila kubwelezeligwa vose! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Mbali mweye weng'heni wende wahasanyi wenu na kuwasang'hanila ganogile, laveni kumwao bila kutamanila kubwelezigwa, na gweko jenu dokua kulu, na mweye mokua wanage Mulungu yeli kuchanha kuulanga. Kwa vija Mulungu kanawende na wabananzi na walibule hewela. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Ivo muwe na bazi kama Tati yenu wa Kuulanga viyeli na bazi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sekemuwalamule wamwenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayo 7:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Sekemuwalamule wamwenga, na mweye hamulamuligwa, seke muwalonge vihile wamwenga namweye sekemulongigwe ivo, walekeseleni wamwenga na mweye molekeseligwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Weng'heni wanhu viwolonda, na mweye mokwing'higwa na Mulungu. Chipimo chimemile na kusindiligwa mbaka malagalila, ivo wanhu viwalonda kuweng'ha mmakono genu. Kwa vija chija chipimo chimpimila wayenu, icho chimpimiligwa na mweye.” <verse eid="LUK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Amala kawalongela ulonzi umwe, “Munhu chipofu kodahaze kumlongoza chipofu miyage, baho wose waidi wonda wengile mdikombo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mwaluko hadaha kumbita mfundaji wake, mbali ija yafundigwe goya kodaha kua kama mfundaji wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Habali kochilola chibale chilimgati ya siso da miago, mbali hudilola bale dilimgati ya siso jako mwenyego? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Hebu kodahaze kumlongela walukolo wako, ‘Ima nikulave chibale chilimgati mmeso gako,’ Mbali hudilola bale dilimmeso gako mwenyego? Kwa chibilikizi gweye! Tanhu lava bale dilimmeso gako, labaho kodaha kuchilola goya chibale chilimgati ya siso da walukolo wako na kuchilava.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki womanyika kwa manhunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Habule mbiki unogile ulela manhunda gehile, hebu mbiki wihile ulela manhunda ganogile. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Wanhu huumanya mbiki kulawila mgamanhunda gage, manake wanhu hawadaha kwaha manhunda ga masada kulawa mmiwa, hebu manhunda ga zambalau kulawa mumbiki wa msonobali. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ivoili munhu yanogile kolava mbuli zinogile kulawa muumoyo wake, nayo munhu yehile kolava gehile kulawa muumoyo wake, kwa vija munhu kolonga gaja gamemile mmoyo wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzengaji yeli na nzewele na mzengaji mbozi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayo 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Habali monikema, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa,’ mbali hamgasang'hana gaja ganiwalongela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nowalagusileni vija viyeli ija munhu yonda kwiza kumwangu na kutegeleza usenga wangu na kuusang'hanila. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Iyo koigala na munhu yazengile ng'anda, kwa kuhimba hasi na kwika msingi ugangamale, labaho halawila bung'hukila da mazi na kutoa haja hazengigwe ija nga'nda mbali haigwile mbe kwa vija ikala izengigwe goya mmabwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Mbali munhu yoyose yohulika usenga unilonga na hausang'hanila, iyo kokua kama munhu yazengile ng'anda yake mumsanga bila kwika msingi, bung'hukila da mazi vidibitile hanu haja ija ng'anda igwa na kubanangika yose!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Nogoli ya afisa wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayo 8:5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu viyakomeleze kugalonga gose gago kwa wanhu wakalile womtegeleza, kaita Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Na mtumigwa imwe yakalile Mkulu wa bumbila da jeshi wa Kilumi iyo yakalile na wende nayo, kakala mtamu ng'hani behi na kudanganika. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Iyo Jemedali viyahulike mbuli za Yesu, kawalagiza Wavele wa Kiyahudi waite kumpula Yesu yaite kumhonya ija mtumigwa wake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Viwavikile kwa Yesu wampula ng'hani yamtaze ija Jemedali walonga, “Munhu ino kweli kolondeka yatazigwe mbuli ino na gweye. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kwa vija iyo kowatogola wanhu wetu, ivija kachizengela kae ya kuiting'hanila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ivo Yesu kailongoza nawo. Viyawile behi na kuvika muikae ya ija Jemedali, ija afisa kalagiza mbwiga zake kumwake walonga, “Mndewa, seke ugae. Manake niye sifaya hata gweye wingile muikae yangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />ivo nie mwenyego niiyona silondeka hata kwiza kumwako. Mbali longa mbuli imwe kumwake nayo mtumigwa wangu kohona. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Manake niye mwenyego nna mkulu wangu, na ivija nna wamilizi weli hasi yangu wonitegeleza malagizo gangu. Nihamlongela imwe ‘Genda!’ Nayo koita, nihamlongela imwenga ‘Izo hano!’ Nayo kokwiza; na iyo mtumigwa wangu, ‘Sang'hana chinhu chino!’ Nayo kosang'hana.’'<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu viyahulike mbuli izo kakanganya, amala kadihindukila bumbila da wanhu wakalile womuwinza, “Nowalongeleni, sinaiona nhogoli ng'hulu kama ino, hata mui Izilaeli!’'<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Na waja wanhu wakalile walagizigwe kwa Yesu viwabwelile ukae wamvika ija mtumigwa kahona.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komzilibula mwana wa mgane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Chipindi chidodo vichibitile, Yesu kaita muikae imwe yokemigwa Naini, kuno yailongoze na waluko wake na bumbila kulu da wanhu diwawinza. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Viyawile behi na kuvika kudilango kulu da ija kae, wanhu wakalile woita kuwanda mwana wa mgane wakala wolawa kunze muikae. Mwana iyo wa chilume yadanganike kakala mwana waiyeka wa mami iyo mgane, na bumbila kulu da wanhu dikala hamwe na mgane iyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mbali Mndewa Yesu viyamonile ija mgane kamonela bazi, kamlongela “Sekeulile.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Amala kadigendela komwa na kujamha, na waja wose wadipapile wema. Yesu kalonga, “Gombwanga, nokulongela lamka wime!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ija munhu yakalile kadanganika kalamuka kakala na kasonga kulonga, nayo Yesu kamwing'ha mami yake iyo mwana.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Wanhu wose wazaganyika na wamtogola Mulungu. walonga, “Lelo mlagusi mkulu wa Mulungu kachizila, Mulungu keza kuhonya wanhu wake!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Mbuli ino yenela Yudea yose na mziisi zili behibehi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawa kwa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matayo 11:2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Waluko wa Yohana Mbatizi viwamulongele mbuli yose viilawile, kawakema waidi wao <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />na kawalagiza wao wakamuuze Yesu, “Ivo gweye iyo ija Yohana yachilongele kokwiza, hebu chimbetele imwenga?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Na waja waluko wake viwavikile kwa Yesu wamlongela, “Yohana imbatizaji kachilagiza chize chikuuze, ‘Gweye iyo ija yokwiza hebu chimlolele imwemga?’“<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Muumsimo uwo uwo Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi weli na vitamu na kawalava wambule vinyamkela, na weli vipofu wengi walola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ivo kawedika waja wasenga wa Yohana, “Mbweleganye kwa Yohana mkamlongele gaja gamuonile na kugahulika, vipofu wolola na mbetembete wogenda na waja weli na dikulu kuhonyigwa na kwing'higwa nyafasi ya kumfugamila Mulungu na mswamagutwi wohulika, na wafile wozilibuligwa, na Usenga Unogile wofundigwa kwa vikumbi muyega. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kamweda munhu ija yonitogola nie!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ivo wasenga waja wa Yohana viwasegele, Yesu kasonga kudilongela dija bumbila da wanhu kwa mbuli ya Yohana, “Vumuitile kuchiwala muita kulola choni? Ivo muita kulola gaja madete gahembelusigwa na beho? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ama muita kuchiwala kulola choni? Hebu ija munhu yavalile vivalo vinogile ng'hani? Mvimanye kua wanhu wavalaga vivalo vinogile, wao wokala mzikae za Wafaume. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ivo nowauzeni, mweye muita kulola choni? Muita kumlola Mlagusi wa Mulungu? Enaa, mbali mulola gamwenga mengi kubita ulagusi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ino iyo mbuli zake zandikigwa mmayandiko, ‘Mulungu kalonga, lola nomgala msenga wangu yakulongolele yakakutandile nzila.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu kagangamiza kulonga, “Yohana iyo munhu mkulu kubita wose. Hataivo ija yeli mdodo muufaume wa Mulungu ni mkulu kubita Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Wanhu wose mbaka wagoga kodi viwahulike mbuli izo wasonga kumtogola Mulungu kwa unovu wake na wabatizigwa na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Mbali Mafalisayo na Wafunda shalia hawautogole usenga uja wa Mulungu kwa kulema kubatizigwa na Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Manye niwalinge na chinhu gani wanhu wa ulelo uno? Mmanye walinga choni? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Wao walinga kama wana wadodo wakalile mdigulilo wokema wayao na wowalongela, ‘Chiwatowela vibundo va lusona mbali hamvinile! chiwembila nyila za giogio mbali hamlilile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Kwa vija Yohana imbatizi keza, na kakala hoja hebu kung'wa divai kuno yopula chila mala, wanhu walonga kambula kinyamkela. <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana wa munhu keza, nayo koja na kung'wa, na mweye molonga, ‘Mloleni ino! Mmelo na mng'waji upele, mbwiga wa wagoga kodi na waja weli na malozo! <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Nzewele ya Mulungu zooneka kweli kwa waja wose wozitogola.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muke yeli na malozo kombaka Yesu mavuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Zua dimwe Mfalisayo kamgoneka Yesu waje hamwe ndia ya ichilo, nayo Yesu kaita kuikae yake kakala hasi yaje. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Na muikae ija hakala na muke imwe yakalile na malozo. Viyahulike Yesu koja muikae ya Falisayo keza na nhyupa yake imemile mavuta gonung'ila <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />na kainamila haukisogo ha magulu ga Yesu, kuno kolila na mahozi gake gosulula mmagulu ga Yesu.Iyo meke kaihangusa migulu ya Yesu kwa mvili zake, amala kainonela na kuihaka na mavuta ganhung'ile. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ija Falisayo yamgoneke Yesu viyaonile gaja, kailongela mwenyego mmoyo, “Maza munhu ino yahawile Mlagusi wa Mulungu, yahavimanyile yelihi yomwanha na muke ino kavilihi na ivija kana malozo!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu kamwidika kamlongela, “Simoni, nna mbuli nolonda nikulongele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Nayo Simoni kedika,“Enaa mfundaji, nongele.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Hakala na wanhu waidi wakopile sente kwa munhu yokopesha,” Yesu kalonga, “Imwe kakopeshigwa dinali mia tano, zoilinga na chitumetume na munhu cha mazua hamsini, imwenga kakopeshigwa dinali, zoilinga na chitumetume cha munhu cha mazua hamsini. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Viwapotigwe kubweleza sente zake, kawalekesela wose waidi. Vuuona yelihi yonda yawe na wende ng'hani na Munhu iyo?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni kamwidika, “Nogesa munhu ija yalekeseligwe deni nyingi iyo yeli na wende ng'hani na iyo yokopesha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu kamwidika, “Kulonga goya.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Amala kamhindukila ija muke, na kamulongela Simoni, “Kumuona muke ino? Niza muikae yako na huning'ile mazi ga kusunha magulu gangu, mbali ino kanisunha magulu gangu kwa mahozi gake na kunihangusa kwa mvili zake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Gweye hunilamse kwa kunihagatila mbali ino muke halekile kuninonela magulu gangu tangia niingile. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Hunibakile ditwi jangu mavuta, mbali muke ino kanibaka magulu gangu gose mafuta gakunung'ila. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ivo nokulongela, wende mkulu uyatendile muke iyo, wolagusa kua kalekeseligwa malozo gake mengi. Mbali kama kulekeseligwa malozo madodo kolagusa wende mdodo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu kamhindukila ija imuke,kamlongela “Kulekeseligwa malozo gako.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baho waja wanhu wamwenga wakalile hamwe nayo mui ndia wasonga kuiuza wenyego, “Yelihi ino yodaha kuwalekesela wanhu malozo?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu kamlongela ija muke, “Nhogoli yako ikulohola, genda kwa utindiwala.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Wake waisondelele na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Amala baho, Yesu kakala yobita bita mzikae, kuno koligula Usenga Unogile kwa mbuli ya ufaume wa Mulungu. Ivija wakala hamwe na waluko wake kumi na waidi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na wake waja walavigwe vinyamkela na kuhonyigwa vitamu vao, Malia kulawa Magdalena iyo yalavigwe Vinyamkela saba <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />wao wakala Yoana mwehe wa Kuza yakalile mkulu ng'anda ya Helode, na Suzana na wake wamwenga wengi wakalile wotumila vinhu vao kuwasang'hanila Yesu na waluko wake.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilaguso cha Mlimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Wanhu wengi wakala wolawa kuno na uko mzikae zao kumuiza Yesu, na vidivikile bumbila kulu Yesu kasonga kulava chilaguso chino,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mlimi kaita kuhanda mbeyu, nayo viyakalile yomiza mbeyu zake, zimwenga zilagalila nzila, zikanyagigwa na wabita nzila na ndege wazija. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Zimwenga zilagalila mmabwe, uhemba vuuzisongile kota, unyala kwavija ulongo ukala unyalile ivo haukalile unyeka. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Zimwenga zilagalila mmiwa, vizikulile miwa iizonga. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Na zimwenga zilagalila muulongo unogile, izo zota na kulela mala mia kubita zija yazihandile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Mchikomelezo, “Yesu kalonga, yeli na magutwi na yahulike!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufwambo lwa mfano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Waluko wake wamuuza Yesu, mfano uno manake choni? <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Nayo kawedika, “Mwing'higwa ubala wa kuumanya ugati wa ufaume wa Mulungu. Mbali kwa wanhu wamwenga wao wolongiligwa kwa mifano, ili wahalola seke waone, na wahahulika seke wavimanye.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula mfano wa mlimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Dino ijo fambulo da mfano uno, mbeyu iyo Usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mbeyu zilagale nzila iyo waja wanhu wahulike Usenga wa Mulungu, mbali mwenembago keza na kuwasegezela mmoyo Usenga wa Mulungu sekewadahe kuutogola na kuloholigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbeyu zilagale muulongo wa mmabwe iyo waja wanhu wahulike Usenga wa Mulungu na kuubokela kwa deng'o, mbali kama zija mbeyu usenga wa Mulungu haukala mmoyo, kwavija hutogola kwa chipindi chidodo tu wahagezigwa chidogo wogwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Mbeyu zilagale mmibiki ya miwa iyo waja wanhu wohulika usenga wa Mulungu, mbali chipindi chidodo chahabita wozongigwazongigwa na kugaya, uzenzi na unovu wa isi ivo hawagendelela kukala mmayandiko ga Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mbali mbeyu zilagale muulongo unogile iyo waja wanhu wauhulike Usenga wa Mulungu na kuubokela kwa moyo mnovu, wanhu hao wofunya moyo mbaka wogendelela kukala mmayandiko ga Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muli ikigwe hasi kudikomwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maluko 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Habule munhu yobwina muli na kwika muuvungu wa komwa. Mbali kokwika mchingolobweda kuwabung'hulila wokwingila mng'anda.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwa vija chochose chifisigwe chokwikigwa hazelu, na chochose chikigwe mchifiso chomanyika na kwikigwa hazelu.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ivo itiganyeni, kwa gaja gamhulika, wose weli na chinhu wokongezeligwa, mbali yelibule chinhu kobokigwa hata chija chidodo yelinacho.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mami yake Yesu na walukolo wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Zua dimwe mami yake Yesu na walukolo wake wamgendela Yesu, mbali wapotigwa kumvikila kwavija hakala na bumbila da wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Munhu imwe kamlongela Yesu, “Mami yako na walukolo wako wahanze wolonda kukuona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Mami yangu na walukolo wangu iyo waja wose wouhulika Usenga wa Mulungu na kuusang'hana.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodikomhokela ng'humbi da mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Zua dimwe Yesu kawalongela Waluko wake, “Chiloke mbaka mmwambu mwa lamba.” Amala wekwela muingalawa hamwe na waluko wake, wasonga kuloka. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Nawo viwakalile muingalawa Yesu kawasa. Hamwande chidogo beho kulu dilawila dilava ng'humbi kulu da mazi dilawila na kwingila muingalawa, baho ngalawa ikala muibung'hukila. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Nao waja waluko wake waita kwa Yesu na kumlamsa walonga, “Go Mndewa go Mndewa lamka chodanganika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu kalamka kadikomhokela beho na ija ng'humbi ya mazi, na dija beho kulu dinyamala na hakala na utindiwala. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Labaho Yesu kawauza waluko wake, “Nhogoli yenu yakulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Mbali waja waluko wakanganya na kudumba na kuiuza wenyego, waiuza “Ivo munhu ino yelihi? Mbaka kodikomhokela beho na ng'humbi da mazi navo vomuhulika!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yambule chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Amala Yesu na Waluko wake waloka mbakamhwani ya isi ya Wagelasi ikanhiza kuita ziwa da Galilaya <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Viyawile yolawa muingalawa na kuvika mhwani, kaiting'hana na munhu imwe wa kae ija yakalile yambule chinyamkela. Munhu iyo kakala havalile chivalo kwa mazua mengi na kakala yokala mmapanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Munhu iyo viyamonile Yesu kaguta nyangi na kamtumbalila mavindi na kaguta nyangi, kalonga kwa dizi kulu “Yesu mwanage Mulungu yeli hachanha ng'hani! Konda kunhendaze? Nokupula sekeunidununze!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kwa vija Yesu kakala kamlongela ija chinyamkela yamlawe munhu iyo. Manake ija chinyamkela kakala yomwambula ija munhu mala nyingi, ila wanhu wakala womwika womhota kwa mhingu mmakono na loda mmagulu. Mbali kazikanha zija loda na mhingu na kugaligwa na chinyamkela mbaka kuchiwala.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Baho Yesu kamuuza, “Gweye zina jako nani?” Kedika kalonga, “Zina jangu 'Bumbila da Mwenembago,” Kwavija kakala kambula vinyamkela wengi.<verse eid="LUK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Waja vinyamkela wakala wopula womgongomeza Yesu seke yawalagize kwingila mdikombo kulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Baho habehi hakala na bumbila kulu da nguluwe, wolisigwa hamgwazo ha lugongo. Ivo vinyamkela waja wampula Yesu yawaleke wawengile nguluwe, nayo kawatogolela yawengile. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Waja vinyamkela viwalawile kwa munhu ija, wawengila nguluwe. Bumbila jose da nguluwe dihulumukila kwa ludabwa kulawa kuchigongo wadidimila mdilamba na wang'wa ng'habu wafa.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Na waja wasusilaji viwaonile dija dilawilile wakimbilila na kuibwililisa mbuli ija mzikae na mvijiji. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Wanhu walawa kuita kulola choni chilawilile, viwavikile kwa Yesu, wamona ija munhu yalavigwe vinyamkela, sambi kahona na kavala vivalo vake na kukala mmagulu mwa Yesu, wanhu waja wadumba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Wanhu waonile mbuli ija wawasimulila wanhu hao vija ija yambule chinyamkela viyahonyigwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Amala wanhu wose wa isi ija ya Wagelasi wampula Yesu yasegele kumwao, kwa vija wakala wodumba ng'hani. Baho Yesu kengila muingalawa kaita zake. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Chipindi Yesu kosegela munhu ija yalavigwe vinyamkela kampula Yesu waite hamwe, “Nokupula nikuwinze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Mbali Yesu kamlagiza na kumlongela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Bwela ukae yako, kasimulile mbuli ng'hulu za Mulungu utendiligwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ija munhu kaita zake chila hanhu kuno kosimulila mbuli ng'hulu ziyatendigwe na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuligwa kwa Biti Yailo na muke imwe kuhonyigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Chipindi Yesu viyabwelile kulawa umwambu mwa Gelasi, wanhu wambokela kwa deng'o kwavija wakala wombeta. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Baho keza munhu imwe yokemigwa Yailo, iyo kakala mkulu mui Kae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. Kamtumbalila mavindi Yesu na kumpula kuita ukae yake, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwa vija biti yake yaiyeka yeli na milao kumi na midi kakala yolumwa behi na kudanganika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Chipindi Yesu viyakalile koita uko wanhu wengi wammemela mhande zose. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ivija baho kukala na muke imwe yakalile yodununzika kwa utamu wa kulawa damu kwa milao kumi na midi, nayo katumila uzenzi wake wose kazambwila walaguzi wa kumhonya mbali wapotigwa kumhonya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Na ija muke kabita hagati ha dija bumbila da wanhu mbaka kamvikila Yesu na kamha mhindo ya valo da Yesu, bahaja utamu wake uhona. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu kauza, “Yelihi yanyamhile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Ivo wanhu wose wabela, mbali Petulo kamwidika, “Go Mndewa, wanhu wano wose wakumemela gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Mbali Yesu kalonga, “Hana munhu kanyamha, manake nivimanya kua udaho unilawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ija muke viyaonile hadaha kuifisa ija mbuli imlawilile, kalawilila kwa Yesu kuno kogudema, na kagwa mmagulu ga Yesu. Yeli haulongozi ha wanhu wose, kamlongela Yesu na wanhu wose wakalile haja, habali kamwamha Yesu na vija viyahonyigwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu kamlongela ija muke, biti yangu nhogoli yako ikuhonya. Genda kwa utindiwala.<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu viyakalile yang'hali kolonga gano, keza mtumigwa ija kulawa ukae kwa Yailo. Kamlongela Yailo, “Biti yako kadanganika, habali umgaze mfundaji?”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Mbali Yesu viyehulike gago, kamlongela Yailo, “Seke udumbe, togola tu, biti yako kohona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yesu viyavikile ukae ya biti Yailo, halondile kwingila mgati na wanhu wamwenga, ila kengila na Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na tati na mami yake ija biti. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Wanhu wose wakala wolila na giogio kwa mwana iyo. Yesu kalonga, “Seke ulile, kwavija mwanago hadanganike mbali kawasa!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Wose wamzeha kwa vija wakala wavimanyile mwana iyo kadanganika. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Mbali Yesu kamgoga mkono wa ija mwana na kamlongela, “Biti, ima!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ugima wake umbwelela, bahaja kenuka. Yesu kawalongela tata na mami yake mwing'heni ndia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Tata na mami yake wakanganya ng'hani, mbali Yesu kawagomesa sekewamlongele munhu yoyose chija chilawilile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalagiza waja kumi na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu kawakema hamwe waja kumi na waidi, kaweng'ha udaho na ukulu wa kulava vinyamkela vose na kuhonya watamu, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />amala kawalagiza kuziligula usenga unogile wa ufaume wa Mulungu na kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Yesu kawalagiza kawalongela, “Sekemsole chochose muumwanza wenu, hebu luboko, hebu mgelo hebu mgate na hebu sente na hebu valo da kaidi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Na mwahabokeligwa muikae yoyose, kaleni muikae iyo mbaka vondamlawe mchijiji icho, <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />kama wanhu hawawabokele mmwao kung'huneni timbwisi da magulu genu kama walema kubokela usenga wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Baho waja waluko wasegela waita chijiji mbaka chijiji, kuno woligula Usenga Unogile wa kuhonya watamu wa chila hanu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwazanywakwa Helode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Baho Mfaume Helode viyahulike gaja gakalile gotendeka, kazanywa ng'hani kwa vija wanhu wamwenga walonga Yohana Imbatizi kazilibuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Mbaki wamwenga walonga Eliya kawalawila, na wamwenga walonga ino iyo Mlagusi wa Mulungu wa umwaka kazilibuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Mbali Helode kalonga, “Iyo nie nimkanha ditwi, mbali iyo munhu gani inihulika mbuli zake?” Ivo kalonda ng'hani kumona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha ndia wanhu elufu tano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Waja mitume wake viwabwelile, wamlongela Yesu gose gawasang'hane. Yesu kawasola wose waita kwa chifiso muikae imwe yokemigwa Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Mbali waja wanhu viwamanyile kuyaitile Yesu wamuwinza, Yesu kawabokela na kulonga nao mbuli ya Ufaume wa Mulungu na kuwahonya waja wose wakalile wonda kuhonyigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Muuswelo wa zua, waja waluko kumi na waidi wamgendela Yesu na kumlongela, “Walage wano wanhu ili waite mvijiji vili habehi, ili kuja ndia na hanhu ha kuwasa, kwa vija hano chili mchiwala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye weng'heni ndia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Wanhu waja wamlongela Yesu,wamidika wamlongela “Hano cheye china migate mitano na somba waidi. Mmane cheye chiite chikagule ndia ya kwiguta bumbila jose dino!” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Haja hakala na walume kama elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Baho Yesu kawalongela waja waluko wake, “Walongeleni wanhu wao wakale chila bumbila wanhu hamsini.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Waja waluko wasang'hana kama viwalongiligwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Amala Yesu kasola ija migate mitano na somba waidi labaho kalola kuulanga kwa Mulungu, ivo kamtogola Mulungu na kamwing'ha Mulungu hewela na kaubena mgate na kuweng'ha waja watumigwa wa Yesu wake wagole kwa wanhu weli mmabumbila. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Wanhu wose waja ndia weguta, amala waja watumigwa wa Yesu wavidondola vija vihande visigale na kumemaza vigelo kumi na vidi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo komtambula Yesu kua Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maluko 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Mdizua dimwe Yesu viyakalile yopula yaiyeka, waluko wake wakala hamwe nayo. Kawauza,Che, “Wanhu wano wonimanyaze?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Wamwidika, “Wamwenga wolonga gweye iyo Yohana Imbatizi,” Mbali wamwenga wolonga, “Gweye iyo Elia, na wamwenga wolonga gweye iyo Mlagusi wa Mulungu kati ya waja Walagusi wa Mulungu waumwaka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu kawauza, “Mweye vilihi, molonga nie nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petulo kedika, “Gweye iyo Kilisito usaguligwe na Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagusa madununzo na ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Maluko 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Baho Yesu kawagomesa ng'hani sekewamlongele munhu yoyose mbuli izo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu kalonga kaidi, yolondeka “Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza kudunuzigwa ng'hani na kulemigwa na wavele vilongozi na wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wafundaji wa ndagizi za Musa, nayo kolondeka yakomigwe na mdizua dakadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Amala Yesu kawalongela wanhu wose, “Munhu yoyose yahalonda kuniwinza yaileme mwenyego, na kolondeka yaniwinze kama mjalusona wangu. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Manake munhu yoyose yonda yauhonye ugima wake mwenyego, kowagiza ugima wake, mbali munhu yonda kwagiza ugima wake kwa mbuli yangu iyo kailohola mwenyego. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Yomfaya choni munhu kuupata chila chinhu muisi, kuno koibananga mwenyego? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Munhu yahanionela niye chinyala na mahala gangu, nanie Mwanage Munhu nokwiza komonela chinyala munhu iyo, vonda yeze muumn'lo wake na kwa Tata na kwa Watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nowalongeleni kweli, hano hana wamwenga hawadanganika kabula hawanauwona ufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogeluka chihanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maluko 9:2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Viyamalile kugalonga gago mazua nane gabitile vino, Yesu kawasola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana kaita nao kulugongo kupula Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Viyakalile kopula, chihanga chake chigeluka, na vivalo vake vikala vizelu chwee. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Bahaja wanhu waidi wakala wolonga nayo, wanhu wao iyo Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />waoneka muumn'lo wa Mulungu, wosimulila na Yesu mbuli ya ifa yake yonda ilawilile uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petulo na wayage wakala wawasa wokuluza, viwalamke muutulo wawona mn'lo wa Yesu na waja wanhu waidi wema hamwe nayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Basi Musa na Elia, viwakalile woita, Petulo kamlongela Yesu, “Go Mndewa, vinoga chee chikale hano. Baho chizenge vibanda vidatu, chimwe chako, na chimwenga cha Musa na chimwenga cha Elia. Mbali Petulo hamanyile choolonga.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petulo viyakalile kogalonga gago, mala wingu dilawilila na kuwagubika, baho waja waluko wadumba ng'hani viwegubikwe mdiwingu ijo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Dizi dihulikigwa kulawa mdiwingu ijo, “Ino iyo mwanawangu nimsagule, mmtegelezeni“. <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Na dizi ijo vidinyamale, Yesu kaoneka yaiyeka. Nao wabaga ivo na hawamlongele munhu yoyose dilawilile mmazua gabitile.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya mwana yambule chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maluko 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Igolo yake Yesu na waja waluko wake wadatu viwahulumuke kulawa kuchigongo, bumbila kulu da wanhu diiting'hanila na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Na munhu imwe kulawa mdibumbila katoa lwangi kalaonga, “Go mfundaji nokupula umlole mwanangu kwa vija iyo mwanangu wachilume yaiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Manake chinyamkela komwambula mwana iyo, komtenda agute nyangi, na kumbwanha na kogwa chifafa na kolawa holovu mmulomo na ivija kogendelela kumdununza na homleka ila mala chidogo! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Niwapula waja waluko wako wamwuwinge iyo chinyamkela, mbali wapotigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye ulelo wa ubananzi mlibule nhogoli na mwagile, nokala na mweye kwa chipindi chitali mbaka lini?” Amala kamhindukila ija munhu na kamlongela, “Mgale hano mwanago.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mwana viyakalile yokwiza, chinyamkela kambwanha hasi na kumgela chifafa, baho Yesu kamkomhokela chinyamkela, na kumhonya imwana na kumwing'ha tata yake. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Wanhu wose wakanganya ng'hani uja udaho mkulu wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu kabwelela kulagusa ifa yake kaidi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Wanhu viwakalile wang'hali wokanganya gaja gose gayasang'hane Yesu, kawalongela waluko wake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mutegeleze goya kwa gano gonda niwalongele sambi, Mwana wa Munhu nogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Mbali waluko wake hawamanyile ulonzi uja, kwa vija mahala ga mbuli ija gafisigwa kumwao, ivo imaana ya ulonzi uwo ufisigwa kumwao, na wadumba kumuuza ulonzi uwo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelihi yondayawe mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Waja waluko wasonga kugomba na kuiuza wenyego, yalihi mmwetu yonda yawe mkulu kubita wose. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Nayo Yesu viyamanyile viwakalile wotonga mmoyo, kamsola mwana mdodo kamwika behi nayo, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />amala kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yonda yambokele mwana ino mdodo kwa vija kunitogola niye, na yonda yanibokele niye iyo kambokela yanilagize. Manake iyo yali mdodo kumwenu, iyo mkulu kubita wose.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu imwenga yolava chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maluko 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana ivija kalonga, “Go Mndewa chimwona munhu kolava chinyamkela kwa zina jako, na cheye chimgoma kwa vija iyo sio mietu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu kawalongela, “Sekemumgomese choyolonda kusang'hana, kwa vija munhu yoyose hasang'hana tafauti ya vumsang'hana iyo mienu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa isi ya Samalia wolema kumbokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Chipindi vichivikile cha Yesu kusoligwa kuita kuchanha kuulanga, iyo kaiyoha kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Kalagiza wasenga wamlongolele, nao waita wengila mchijiji chimwe cha Samalia ili wamtandile goya chila chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Mbali wenekae hawalondile kumbokela kwa vija wavimaja kua kakala koita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Waja waluko wake Yakobo na Yohana viwaonile gago walonga, “Go Mndewa kolonda chilagize moto kulawa kuchana kuulanga wize kuwalunguza?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Mbali Yesu kawahindukila kawabwakila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Yesu na waluko wake waita mchijiji chimwenga.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waja wofaya kua waluko wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayo 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Viwakalile woita uko, kalawilila munhu imwe kamlongela Yesu, “Niye nokuwinza hohose hauita.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu kamlongela “mbweha kana mhango, na udege wa kuulanga wana mvulu, mbali mwana wa munhu kabule hanhu hakuwasa hebu kuhumula.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu kamlongela munhu imwenga, “Niwinze”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Iyo munhu kamlongela Yesu, “Go Mndewa tanhu nileke niite nikamuwande Tatiyangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu kamlongela, “Waleke wafile wawawande wafile wayao. Mbali gweye genda kazilonge mbuli za Ufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Munhu imwenga ivija kamlongela, “Go Mndewa nie nokuwinza, mbali nokupula tanhu ning'he nyafasi niite kuwalaga waja waukae yangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yasongile kulima, amala kahinduka kuchisogo iyo hafaya Muufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalagiza waja sabini na waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Viyakomeleze gago Mndewa akawabagula waja sabini na waidi na kawalagiza waidi waidi waite chila kae kuja kuyalondile kuita iyo mwenyego. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yesu Kawalongela, “Mndewa wa va kugobola vingi mmigunda mbali wagobolaji wadodo. Ivo mpuleni iyo Mndewa wa kugobola yagale wagobolaji mumgunda wake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mgende! mvimanye, nowalagiza kama wana bung'hukilalo hagati ha mbwisi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Seke umsole sente hebu mgelo hebu vilatu, ivija seke mumlamse munhu yoyose mnzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Mwahengila muikae yoyose, molondeka muwalamuse vino, ‘Utindiwala ukale na mweye.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Kama kuna munhu yeli na utindiwala, utindiwala wenu wokala nayo, mbali kama habule yeli na utindiwala, utindiwala wenu wowabwelela. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Baho kaleni muikae iyo, muje na kung'wa va ukae yao, manake chila msang'hanaji sang'hano kolondeka kwing'higwa chitumetume chake. Seke muite muisi ino hebu ija. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kama mwahingila muisi yoyose na wanhu wahawabokela, diyeni vumtandiligwe, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />wahonyeni watamu wakalile uko, walongeleni wanhu weli baho,’Ufaume wa Mulungu wammabehi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Mbali mwahengila muisi yoyose, na hawawabokele, laweni muite mzinzila zake na kulonga, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />'Ivija dija timbwisi da muisi yenu digogile magulu getu chodikung'husa. Mbali mvimanye kua Ufaume wa Mulungu wa habehi!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Niye nowagangamiza mdizua da chitala, wanhu wa isi iyo wopata madununzo ng'hani kubita wajawa isi ya Sodoma!”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woluona wanhu wa isi zilemile kuleka malozo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Moluona mweye wanhu wa Kolazini na moluona mweye wanhu wa Betisaida! Kama uzonza uja utendeke kumwenu uhatendeke kuja Tilo na Sidoni bahaja wanhu wahamfugamile Mulungu na kuleka malozo gao, kuno wavalile vikumbi na kubakala maivu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mbali mdizua da kulamula yobuha kwa Tillo na Sidoni kufunya moyo nyinukila ya Mulungu kubita mweye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na gweye wanhu wa isi ya Kapelenaumu, che! kodaha kuinula mbaka kuchanha kuulanga? Habule, kohulumusigwa mbaka kwa wanhu wadanganike.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Amala Yesu kalonga na Waluko wake, “Munhu yomuhulikeni mweye iyo kanihhulika niye, na iyo yowalema mweye konilema na niye. Mbali iyo yonilema niye, baho komlema iyo yanilagize.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa waja sabini na waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Waja sabini na waidi wabwela kwa deng'o na kulonga, “Go Mndewa, hata vinyamkela vowalawa wanhu vichiwakomokela kwa udaho wako!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu kawedika, nimwona ija Mwenembago kogwa kulawa kuchanha Kuulanga kama lumwesa. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Yesu kawalongela, tegelezeni, niweng'heni udaho wa kubojoga nyoka na inge na 'ludabwa mkulu kwa wahasanyi wenu, habule chinhu chonda chiwadahe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Mbali sekemuigode kwa vija vinyamkela wowahulika, mbali deng'heleleni kwa vija mazina genu gandikigwa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kana deng'o</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13:16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Chipindi icho Yesu viyabokele Muhe wa Mulungu kadeng'helela kalonga, “Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga na kuiisi nokwing'ha hewela kwavija kuwafisa mbuli ino weli na nzewele na weli na ilimu, mbali kuwalagusila wana wadogo. Enaa Tata, vuulondile ilawilile.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Amala kalonga, “Tataangu kanidahiza kusang'hana mbuli zose, na habule munhu yoyose yammanyile Mwana ila Tata, hebu yammanyile Tata ila Mwana, na yoyose ija Mwana yomlonda komfunhulila.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Amala Yesu kawahindukila Waluko wake kawalongela kwa kifiso, “Gamweda meso golola gamlola mweye! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Manake nowalongela, Walagusi wa Mulungu na Wafaume walonda kuona gamuona mweye mbali hawagaone, na kuhulika gamhulika mbali hawahulike.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa munhu wa Samalia yeli na wende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Bahaja kema Mfundaji wa ndagizi imwe kamgeza Yesu, kamuuza, “Mfundaji, nhende choni mhate ugima ulibule uhelelo?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu kamuuza, “Mgamayandiko gandikwaze kwa mbuli ya ndagizi za Musa? Na gweye kumanya choni? <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Ija munhu Kedika, kalonga “Mtogole Mndewa Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose, na kwa muhe wako wose na ludabwa wako wose, na kwa ubala wako wose, ‘Na mwing'he wende miago kama vuuwing'ha mwenyego.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu kamlongela “Kulonga goya,” “Tenda ivo na gweye kokua na ugima.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Mbali ija mfundaji wa ndagizi viyalondile kuilagusa kua kana ubala kamuuza Yesu, “Miangu nie yelihi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu kedika kalonga, munhu imwe kalawa Yelusalem kuita Yeliko, viyakalile nzila wabavi wamvamila na kumvula vivalo vake na kutoa na kumboka chila chinhu, na wamleka bahaja behi na kudanganika. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Labaho mlava nhambiko imwe kakala yobita nzila ija, viyamonile munhu ija yavamiligwe na wabavi kabita kumgwazo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Amala kabita mwanahina wa mlava nhambiko imwe nayo viyamonile munhu ija yavamiligwe na wabavi kabita kumgwazo ivija. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Mbali munhu imwe wa isi ya Samalia viyakalile muumwanza, kabita haja hakalile munhu ija na viyamonile kamonela bazi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kaita kwa munhu ija kamsunha goya vilonda vake amala kamgela divai na kumfunga, baho kamkweza mchihongwe wake amala kamgala muing'anda yakugona nyambenyambe ili wamlole goya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Viivikile igolo, ija munhu wa isi ya Samalia kalava vihande vidi va madini ga sente ng'hulu kamwing'ha mlolezi wa ija ng'anda, na kamlongela, “Mlole goya ino mtamu na kama sente zokongezeka, niye nahabwela nokwiza kukuliha.”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Labaho Yesu kauza, Vuutonga kwa wanhu waja wadatu yelihi iyo miage munhu ija yatoigwe na Majambazi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Na mfundaji wa ndagizi za Musa kedika, kalonga “Ija yamonele bazi iyo miage.” Yesu kamlongela, “Genda kasang'hane ivoivo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaita kuwalola Mata na Malia ukae yao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Amala Yesu viyakalile yoita Muumwanza na Waluko wake, wengila mchijiji chimwe na muke imwe yokemigwa Mata kambokela ukae yake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Nayo Mata kakala na mwali yokemigwa Malia iyo kakala mmagulu ga Yesu kuno komtegeleza Yesu mbuli ziyolonga. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Mbali Mata kakala yohunganika na mbuli nyingi, amala Mata kaita kwa Yesu kamuuza, “Mndewa komona ino mwali viyanilekile nihunganike niiyeka? Ivo mlongele yeze yanitaze!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Baho Mndewa kalonga, “Gweye Mata! koigaza na mbuli nyingi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />mbali cholondeka chinhu chimwe tu chinogile, na Malia kakisagula na habule munhu yonda yamboke.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowafunda waluko wake vija viilondeka kupula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Zua dimwe Yesu kakala hanhu hammwe vino yompula Mulungu. Viyakomeleze kupula, mwaluko wake imwe kamlongela, “Mndewa na cheye chifunde kupula kama vija Yohana imbatizi viyawafundile waluko wake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwahapula, longeni vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tata yetu uli kuulanga kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Zina jako dinhang'hane ditogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">na ufaume wako wize.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Uching'he ndia yetu mazua gose.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ugele kumgongo malozo getu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kama na cheye vichigela kumgongo malozo ga waja wachihasanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Hebu seke uchingize mmagezo. ' “<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Amala Yesu kawauza, “Yelihi mmwenu yaitile kwa mbwigaake chilo chikulu na kumlongela, ‘Mbwiga ng'opeshe migate midatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />kwa vija mbwigaangu kammwanza keza kumwangu na niye nabule chinhu cha kumwing'ha.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Amala ija munhu yeli mng'anda yamwidike yalonge, Sekeunigaze, lwivi uhindigwa, na niye na wanangu chigona, ivo sidaha kulamka nikwing'he chinhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nowalongela kua, hata kama munhu iyo holamka na kumwing'ha iyo migate, mbali kwa mbuli ija ya kugendelela kupula, baho kolamka koita kumwing'ha chija choyolonda. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ivo nowalongeleni, Puleni na mweye mokwing'higwa, zambwileni, na mweye mobokela, na toweni hodi, na mweye movuguliligwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwa vija chila munhu yopula hwing'higwa na ija yozambwila hubokela, na iyo yotowa hodi huvuguliligwa ulwivi. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Tata yelihi kumwenu, mwanage yahampula somba nayo komwing'ha nyoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Hebu mwana yahapula finga, komwing'ha inge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Kama mweye mli na ubananzi modaha kuweng'ha wanenu vinhu vinogile, Mbali Tata yenu yeli kuulanga kodaha ng'hani koweng'ha Muhe wake wose wompula!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maluko 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Mdizua dimwe Yesu kakala kolava chinyamkela yamtendile munhu imwe kua na ludanha, na ija chinyamkela viyamlawile munhu ija yeli na ludanha, bahaja munhu ija kasonga kulonga kwa mlomo wake. Na bumbila kulu da wanhu dikanganya, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />mbali wanhu wamwenga mmwao walonga, “Ino Belizebuli, mkulu wa vinyamkela, komdahiza kulava vinyamkela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Na wamwenga wamgeza ili yalave malaguso kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Mbali Yesu kawamanya viwotonga, kawalongela, “Chila ufaume wahaigola na kugomba wenyego kwa wenyego haukala, nayo ivija wanhu wa kae imwe wahaigola wenyego kwa wenyego yobanangika. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Kama Mwenembango koihasanya mwenyego, yokuwaze ufaume wake okwimaze? Nowalongeleni vino kwa vija mweye Molonga kua nolava vinyamkela kwa udaho wa Belizebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Kama niye nolava Vinyamkela kwa udaho wa Beelizebuli, wajalusona wenu hulava Vinyamkela kwa udaho wa yelihi? Kwa mbuli iyo wao wokuwa Walamuzi wenu! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Mbali niye nahalava chinyamkela kwa udaho wa Mulungu, baho mvimanye Ufaume wa Mulungu uwavikila.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Munhu yeli na ludabwa yahma vinhu vose va kuitowela na kuikimila kae yake na vinhu vake vose havisiloligwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Mbali munhu yeli na ludabwa ng'hani kubita iyo, yaheza komtoa na kumhuma na komboka vinhu vake vose va kuitowela, na vose viyotamanila na kusola vinhu vake na kuvigola kwa Wamilizi wake.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Munhu yoyose si wangu iyo kweli honitogola, ivija munhu yoyose hokunzanya hamwe na niye iyo kopwililisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Chinyamkela yahalawa kwa munhu, kobitabita mluwala kuno kolonda hanhu hakuhumula, mbali kama hapatile hanhu hohose hakukala, koilongela mwenyego, ‘Nobwela muikae yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Yahabwela na kuivika kae ija ifagiligwa na kuhambigwa goya. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Baho koita kaidi kusola vinyamkela wamwenga saba kubita iyo mwenyego, wokwingila na kukala umo. Ivo ugima wa munhu iyo wokwiha ng'hani kubita haumwanduso.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unovu unogigile kulawa kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu viyakalile kogalonga gano, muke imwe haja mdibumbila da wanhu kaguta dizi kulu kalonga, “Kamweda muke yakulelile na kukukong'heza!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Mbali Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Wamweda ng'hani waja wahulike usenga wa Mulungu na kuutogola.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo ulonda Laguso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Bumbila da wanhu vidikalile dokongezeka, Yesu kagendelela kufunda kuno kolonga,“Ulelo uno waubananzi! Wozambwila vilaguso, mbali habule yonda yaweng'he, ila uja wa Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Manake kama vija Yona viyawile laguso kwa wanhu wa Ninawi, ivo vonda iwe kwa Mwana wa Munhu kwa mbuli ya ulelo uno. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mdizua da ulamuzi, Mfaume wa Chike kolawila chipindi ulelo uno vondaulamuligwe, nayo kowalamula kua wahumigwa, kwavija iyo kalawa kutali kwiza kutegeleza nzewewe kulawa kwa Selemani. Mbali kumbe hano hana mkulu kubita Selemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Zua ijo da kulamula wanhu kulawa Ninawi wokwima hamwe na ulelo uno na kuwagala mchitala, kwa vija wao watumbala mafindi viwehulike Yona kofunda. Mbali sambi kabaha iyo yeli Mkulu kubita Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22">6:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Habule munhu yobwinha lumuli na kuika hanhu hafisike, hebu kuigubika na nongo. Mbali koika hachingolobweda, ili wanhu wose wokwingila wadahe kuona. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Meso gako iyo lumuli lwa lukuli lwako. Kama meso gako gahawa magima, lukuli lwako wose wobung'huligwa. Mbali kama meso gako gahabanangika, lukuli lwako ivija wokua mdiziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Kwa ivo, uitiganye, bung'hulo dili mgati yako seke diwe ziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Basi kama lukuli lwako wose wamdibung'hulo, na habule hanhu hohose helimdiziza, baho lukuli lwako wose lobung'huka kama vija lumuli vuubung'hula.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawakomhokela Mafalisayo na Wafundaji wa ndagizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu viyakomeleze kulonga mbuli iyo, Mfalisayo imwe kamgoneka Yesu yaite ukae yake kuja ndia. Yesu kengila na kukala yaje ndia. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Na ija Mfalisayo kakanganya viamonile Yesu koja ndia bila kusunha makono gake. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mbali Mndewa kamlongela, “Mweye Mafalisayo mosunha via venu kwa kunze mbali mgati yenu mmema umelo na ubananzi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mweye mwa wabozi! Havimmanya kama yasang'hane kunze iyo yasang'hane mgati ivija? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Basi mlave vinhu vose mlinavo kwa vikumbi muyega kwa moyo unogile, na mweye motogoleka.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Moluona mweye Mafalisayo, kwa vija hamlonda kuwatendela wamwenga ganogile na kumwing'ha wende Mulungu. Baho momlavila Mulungu vinhu vidodo, kama mboga za mayani na vilungo va ndia. Mulondeka kuwatendela goya wamwenga na kumwing'hana wende Mulungu kwa kumlavila fungu dimwe mgamafungu kumi. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Moluona mweye Mafalisayo, kwa vija mlondaga kukala vigoda va ulongozi Muikae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kulamsigwa kwa nhogoli mmagulilo. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />“Moluona kwa vija mweye kama mapanga hagekigwe manga, baho wanhu wobita kuchanha bila kuvimanya.” <verse eid="LUK 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Munhu imwe yasomile ndagizi kemwidika kamlongela, “Go Mfundaji, vuulonga mbuli izo kuchiliga na cheye ivija.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu kedika kalonga, “Na mweye wafundaji wa ndagizi, moluona kwa vija mowapika wanhu mizigo izamile haidahika kupapigwa, hebu mweye wenyego hamwinula kuwataza hata kwa chidole chimwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />“Moluona kwa vija mozenga mapanga ga walagusi wa Mulungu waja wakomigwe na watata zenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwa ivo mweye molola na kuzitogola mbuli wazitendile watata zenu, wao wawakoma waja walagusi wa Mulungu na mweye mowazengela mapanga gao kuno mozitogola ifa zao. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kwa mbuli ino, Mulungu muinzewele yake akalonga, ‘Lola, nowalagiza kumwao Walagusi wa Mulungu na Watumigwa wangu, nao wowakoma wanhu wamwenga na kuwadununza.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ivo ulelo uno wokwinukiligwa kwa mbuli ya kwitila ija damu ya Walagusi wa Mulungu, kulawa kuimisimikilo ya isi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kulawa kwitika damu ya Abeli mbaka ija ya Zakaria, yakomigwe mchilemela na haja hanhu hanang'hane. Enaa, nowalongela, ulelo uno wokwinukiligwa kwa mbuli zose zino.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Moluona mweye wafudaji wa ndagizi, kwa vija muwagomesa wanhu kummanya Mulungu, na mweye wenyego hamummanyile Mulungu na waja walondile kwingila muwagomesa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu viyalawile haja, wafundaji wa ndagizi na Mafalisayo wasonga kumzonga ng'hani na kumuuza mauzo mengi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />kuno womsepa ili wamgoge kwa mbuli yazilongile.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakomokela Vibilikizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Matayo 10:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Msimo uwo, bumbila kulu da wanhu dikala doikunzanya hamwe, mbaka wakala woibojoga, Yesu akasonga kulonga na waluko wake, akawalongela, “Itiganyeni seke muwageze Mafalisayo, na ubilikizi wao. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Habule mbuli yoyose igubikigwe haigubuligwa hebu habule mbuli ifisigwe mdiziza sekeivumbuligwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwa ivo jojose dilongigwa mdiziza dohulikigwa hazelu, na chija chimnyongónye mgati na lwivi luhindigwa chosimuliligwa hazelu.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yolondeka kudumbigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Niye nowalongeleni mweye bwiga zangu, seke muwadumbe waja wokoma lukuli, amala hawadaha kuwatendela chinhu chochose. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Mbali nowalongela ija yolondeka mumdumbe, Mdumbeni ija, yookoma lukuli na yahamala kukoma kanao udaho wa kukwaza mmoto ulibule uhelelo. Nowagangamizila mdumbeni iyo yaiyeka!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Movimanya kama sholwewanda watano woguligwa kwa sente mbili? Mbali Mulungu hamsemwa hata munhu imwe mmwao. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Enaa, hata mvili mmatwi genu zose zipetigwa. Seke mdumbe, mweye wanhu mtogoligwe ng'hani kubita hao sholwewanda wengi!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola na kumbela Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19">10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nowalongela kua, munhu yoyose yonda yanitangaze kua kahamwe na niye nayo Mwana wa Munhu nayo kumtangaza kua kahamwe nayo hawatumigwa wa kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Mbali munhu yonibela hawanhu, Mwana wa munhu nayo kombela hawatumigwa wa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Na chila munhu yomlonga Mwana wa munhu malozo gake gogeligwa kumgongo, mbali yoyose yomliga Muhe wa Mulungu malozo gake hagageligwa kumgongo mbe!<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Na wahawagala Wazikae za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, haulongozi ha wakulu na weli na malamuzi, seke mdumbe kwa mbuli kuiuza vija vumlonda kulonga. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwa vija Muhe wa Mulungu mchipindi icho kowafunda vumlondeka kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa Mzenzi mbozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Munhu imwe mdibumbila da wanhu kamlongela Yesu, “Go Mfundaji, mulongele mkulu wangu chiibagulile uhazi wetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Mbali Yesu akamlongela, “Mbwigaangu, yalihi yanikile niye kuwemila hebu munhu wa kuwabagulila mweye uhazi?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Amala Yesu akawalongela wanhu hao, “Itiganyeni na chila maya, manake ugima wa munhu wahabule mvinhu vingi yelinavo munhu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Amala Yesu akawalongela uno mfano, “Mgunda wa munhu imwe mzenzi ulela ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Baho akasonga kutonga mmoyo wake, akalonga, nhendeze? Manake habule hanhu hakwika ndia zinigobole. <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Amala iyo mzenzi akalonga vino 'chino icho chonda nisang'hane, “Nobena magulu gangu na kuzenga gamwenga makulu ng'hani, naumo nike ndia yangu ya mlao navinhu vimwenga. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Labaho noilongela mwenyego,”Oo! muhe wangu, vino vinhu vinogile vingi uvikile gonelo kwa milao mingi, sambi muhe wangu humula uje na ung'we na kudeng'helela!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Mbali Mulungu akamlongela, ‘Gweye kwa mbozi! Lelo ichilo wolondeka muhe wako, Na ivo vinhu vose vuwikile mmane vokua vanani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Mchikomelezo Yesu kalonga, “Ivoili kwa wanhu woikila uzenzi wao wenyego, mbali habule chinhu Mulungu yachionile chinoga ng'hani.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumanile mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Amala Yesu akawalongela waluko wake, “Sekemgae kwa mbuli ya ugima wenu, kua moja choni, hebu ng'huli zenu kua movala choni. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwa vija ugima unoga kubita ndia na lukuli unoga kubita vivalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Amala waloleni ndege hawahanda hebu kugobola, wabule gulu hebu hanhu hakwika ndia, mbali Mulungu kowalisa. Ivo mweye motogoligwa ng'hani kubita ndege! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ivo yalihi kumwenu kwa kuigaza kodaha kuyongezela mwenyego ugima wake hata kwa saa dimwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Basi kama hamdaha kusang'hana mbuli ndodo kama iyo, habali muigaze kwa mbuli zimwenga? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Galoleni gago malua vigakula, hagasang'hana sang'hano hebu kuizinga, mbali nowalongeleni hata Mfaume Selemani yakalile na unovu mkulu, hapatile kuvazigwa goya kama lua ijo dimwe vidili. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Basi kama Mulungu kogeka vino gago mayani ga kumgunda, vija lelo gabaha mbali igolo gokwasigwa mmoto, che! honda yawasang'hanile mweye ng'hani! Mweye mli na nhogoli chidodo!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Mweye seke muhunganike mmoyo moja choni hebu mong'wa choni, ivija seke mdumbe kwa mbuli iyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Wamhazi wogaya ng'hani kuzambwila vinhu vino vose. Mbali Tata yenu yeli kuulanga kavimanya kua movilonda vinhu vino. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ivo zambwileni tanhu Ufaume wa Mulungu na vinhu vino navo mokwing'higwa ivija.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuikila Uzenzi wa Kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mweye bumbila dodo sekemdumbe, kwa vija Tata yenu kaona goya kuweng'ha uja ufaume wake. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Guleni vinhu mlinavo, amala zisente muweng'he vikumbi muyega. Ilukeni goya Mikadi ya sente seke idegeke, muuikile usigavu kuulanga kwa Mulungu, hanhu wabavi hawadaha kwiba hebu ving'onyo havidaha kuubananga. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kwa vija haja hauli uzenzi wako, baho honda moyo wako hauli ivija.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wosang'hana goya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Muitande kusang'hana sang'hano, na vimuli venu viwe vokwaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />mkale kama vija watumigwa wombeta Mndewa wao yabwele kulawa mdizengele, ili yahavika na kupula yavuguliligwe lwivi, baho wamvugulile hima. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Watumigwa waja wodeng'helela, kwa vija Mndewa wao vonda yeze yahawavika wombeta. Togoleni nowalongela, iyo Mndewa vonda yeze kovala vivalo vautumigwa na kuwalongela wakale hasi nayo koweng'ha ndia. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Watumigwa waja wokua na deng'o Mndewa wao vonda yeze na kuwavika wang'hali wombeta, hata kama yaheza ichilo ng'hani! Hebu lukwili! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Mbali muimanye mbuli ino, kama mwenekae yahavimanyile saa ya kwiza mbavi muikae yake, yahakalile meso ili mbavi sekeyeze kuibananga ng'anda. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Na mweye ivija mgangamale, kwa vija hamnavimanya chipindi vonda yeze Mwana wa munhu.<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa yotogoleka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Pita kauza, “Mndewa mfano uo kochilongela cheye chiiyeka hebu kwa wanhu wose?<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Baho Mndewa kamwidika, “Yelihi kumwenu, yeli mtumigwa wa Mulungu, na yeli na nzewele, vija Mndewa wake yaheza kumwika kua mkulu wa kae yake yose, na iyo yaweng'he ndia yao waja watumigwa wamwenga mchipindi chinogile? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kamweda mtumigwa ija, vija Mndewa wake yaheza komvika kosang'hana ivo! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Togoleni nowalongela, iyo mtumigwa kokwing'higwa ukulu wawimilizi kwa vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Mbali ija mtumigwa yahailongela mummoyo wake, mndewa wangu kokawa kubwela, kasonga kuwatoa waja watumigwa wamwenga, wa chilume na wa chike, na kuno koja ndia na kung'wa mbaka kokoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mdizua hadimanyile, iyo mndewa vonda yeze komtoa ng'hani na kumwika hamwe na waja wanhu wasiotogoleka.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Na kwa mtumigwa ija yovimanya goyolonda mndewa wake, amala mwenyego hakala goya, hebu hagasang'hana goyolondigwa na mndewa wake, iyo kotoigwa ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Mbali kwa ija havimanyile goyolonda mndewa wake, amala kasang'hana gaja galondeke kutoigwa, kotoigwa chidogo. Na kwa chila yeng'higwe vinhu vingi, kumwake iyo volondeka vingi, na kwa ija yeng'higwe ukulu munhu iyo kouzigwa ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatenda wanhu kuibagula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Niza kusoma moto muiisi, nogesa maza waasongile kwaka! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Mbali inago madununzo makulu ganilondeka nidununzwe, na nogazigwa ng'hani mbaka vondagatimile! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Che! motonga niza muuisi kugala utindiwala? Bule, niza kugala kuibagula. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Na kulawa vino sambi muikae imwe hokua na wanhu watano waibagule, wadatu kwa waidi na waidi kwa wadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tata na mwanage woibagula, na mwana na tata yake woibagula, na biti na mamiyake woibagula, mkoi wa chilume na mwanage wa chilume woibagula, na muke na mkoi wake wa chike woibagula.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuutambula msimo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2">Matayo 16:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu ivija kadilongela bumbila da wanhu, mwahaona wingu dolawila muuswelo wa zuwa, baho molonga sambi mvula yokwiza, kweli yokwiza. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na mbeho ya ubanzi wa hasi viyobuma, mweye molonga, yokua na fuguto, kweli yokua. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mweye mwavibilikizi! Mvimanya kufambula mbuli ya mbeho kwa kulola mbeho ya isi na kuchanha kuulanga, ivo habali hammanya kufambula mbuli zilawilila sambi?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilumbe na wahasanyi wako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25">Matayo 5:25</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:26">26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Habali mweye wenyego hamulamula mbuli igoloke? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Manake wahawa na mhasanyi wako mzila kuita mchitala, yolondeka kuilumba nayo mng'hali muimnzila, ili seke yakugale kwa ludabwa kwa mlamuzi wa chitala, na ija mlamuzi nayo yakugale hammilizi, na ija mmilizi yakugale muing'anda ya wafungigwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Niye nokulongela, hudaha kulawa umo mgati mbaka uilihe ija sente ya ngama.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Lekeni malozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Msimo uwo hakala na wanhu wamlongela Yesu mbuli za wanhu wamwenga wa Galilaya, na Pilato kalagiza wakomigwe na damu yao ihanyigwe na damu ya wanyama kwa mbuli ya nhambiko. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu kawauza, “Ivo mweye mogesa kua zino zilawilila kwa vija wano Wagalilaya wakala na malozo kubita Wagalilaya wose? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Niye nowalongela sio kwa mbuli iyo, mbali kama na mweye hamlekile malozo genu, modanganika kama wao. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Hebu mweye mogesa hata uja mnala wa Siloam viugwile na kuwakoma waja wanhu kumi na nane, wakala malozo kubita wanhu wose wakalile Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nowalongela sio kwa mbuli iyo, mbali kama hamlekile malozo, na mweye modanganika kama wao.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mbiki wa mtini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Amala Yesu akawalongela mfano uno, “Munhu imwe kakala na mbiki wake wa manhunda mumgumgunda wa mizabibu, viyaitile kwaha manhunda, mbali hagapatile. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ivo akamlongela ija mtumigwa wa uja mgunda wake, ‘Lola, milao midatu yose nikala nokwiza kwaha manhunda ga mbiki uno, mbali sinapata chinhu, ivo ukanhe mbiki uno! Habali woibananga isi ino?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ija mtumigwa akamlongela, ‘mndewa tanhu uleke kwa mlao uno umwe kaidi, na niye nouhalilila na kugela mboji. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Kama wahalela manhunda mumsimo ukwiza yokua goya, mbali kama haulelile basi ukanhe.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya muke imwe mdizua da kuhumula da Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Mdizua da kuhumula da Wayahudi, Yesu kakala yofunda Muikae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Baho hakala na muke imwe yakalile mtamu wa milao kumi na nane, kwavija kakala yambule chinyamkela mbaka kamtenda yawe na kinhumbi ivo kapotigwa kwima kwa kugoloka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu viyamonile kamkema, akamlongela, “Gwee muke, ima kuhonyigwa kinhumbi ulinacho!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yesu viyamwikile makono gake muke iyo, bahaja kenuka goya na kumtogola Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Mbali mkulu wa Kae ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi kagevuzika kwa vija Yesu kamhonya muke iyo mdizua da kuhumula da Wayahudi. Ivo iyo mkulu Kae yakuiting'hanila Wayahudi kagendelela kudilongela dija bumbila da wanhu,”hana mazua sita ga kusang'hana sang'hano zenu, ivo mwize mmazua gago kuhonyigwa, mbali sio mdizua da kuhumula da Wayahudi!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Baho mndewa kalonga, “Mweye wanhu vibilikizi, yelihi kumwenu mdizua ijo da kuhumula da Wayahudi seke yamlave ng'ombe hebu mhunda wake kuita kung'wa mazi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Na ino muke wa ulelo wa Ibulahimu, yadununzigwe na chinyamkela kwa milao kumi na minane, baho halondeke kulekeseligwa madununzo gake mdizua ijo da kuhumula da Wayahudi?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, waja wahasanyi wake wagwa chinyala, mbali wanhu wamwenga wose wadeng'helela kwa mbuli za uzonza zisang'hanigwe nayo.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mbeyu ndodo ya mbiki wa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matayo 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Amala Yesu kauza, “Choni chiilinge na ufaume wa Mulungu? Mmane na niye niulinge na choni? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Uilinga na mbeyu ndodo ya mbiki wa haladali, na yaisolile munhu imwe na kaita kuhanda mumgunda wake, nao ulela ukula kua mbiki mkulu. Na mgamakwamvi gake, ndege wa kuulanga wazenga mvulu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa usasu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayo 13:33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu kauza kaidi, “Niulinge nachoni uno Ufaume wa Mulungu? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Noulinga na uja usasu usoligwe na ija muke yaitile kuhanganya mja mgamadebe madatu ga usage amala uwo usage wose usasuka ivija.<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwivi msisili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13">Matayo 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:21-23">14:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu mumsimo wake wa kuita Yelusalemu kakala yobita muzikae na mvijiji kuno yofunda. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Munhu imwe kamuuza Yesu, “Go Mndewa ivo wanhu woloholigwa wadodo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu kawedika, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Lopoleni kwingila kubitila lwivi uno msisili, kwa vija nowalongela kweli wanhu wengi wogeza kwingila mbali hawadaha kwingila. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Chipindi chokwiza baho mwenekae yalamke na kuuhinda lwivi, na mweye mwima hanze na kutoa hodi na kulonga, ‘Mndewa chivugulile ulwivi!’ Mbali nayo kowalongela, niye sivugula lwivi kwa vija mweye siwamanyale kumlawa!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Baho mosonga kulonga, ‘Ching'wa na kuja hamwe na gweye, ivija gweye kuchifunda cheye mvibuga vetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Mbali nayo kowalongela, ‘Niye mweye siwamanya hebu kumlawa. Segeleni hano kumwangu mweye wabananzi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Baho Yesu kagendelela kulonga, mwahamona Isaka na Yakobo na Walagusi wa Mulungu wose, wahawa mu Ufaume wa Mungu, na mweye mokua mwasigwa kunze baho mokua na ludoko na kusiginha meno! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Wanhu wokwiza kulawa ubanzi wa usimbukilo wa zuwa na ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa, na kulawa ubanzi wa kuchanha na ubanzi wa hasi, na wose wokwiza kukala hanhu hao waje ndiya watandiligwe na Mulungu nayo Mulungu kowalongoza. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Lola waja waulongozi wokua wakuchisogo na waja weli kuchisogo wokua haulongozi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolombokeza kwa kae ya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayo 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mchipindi icho, Mafalisayo na wanhu wamwenga waita kwa Yesu na wamlongela, “Lawa hano usegele hanhu hamwenga, kwa vija Mfaume Helode konda kukukoma.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu kawalongela, “Gendeni mkamlongele vino io mbwisi, niye nabaha lelo na igolo nolava wanhu vinyamkela na kuwahonya watamu wose, mbali mdizua da kadatu noikomeleza sang'hano yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nolondeka kugendelela na mwanza wangu wangu lelo na igolo na ikisindo, kwa vija Mlagusi wa Mulungu, halondeka kudanganika hanhu hengine mbali na Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelusalemu, gwee Yelusalemu, gwee uwakoma walagusi wa Mulungu, na kuawatoa na mabwe Wasenga watumigwe kumwako! Mala nying'hahi nikukunzanya kama nguku viyakunzanya vinzia vake mmabawa gake, mbali hamtogole! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Loleni kae yenu ilekigwa uchiwa. Na niye nowalongela hamniona kaidi mbe, mbaka vonda mlonge, ‘Kamweda iyo yokwiza kwa zina da Mndewa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya mtamu yavimbile lukuli lose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mdizua dimwe da kuhumula Yesu viyagonekigwe kuja ndia muikae ya munhu imwe mkulu wa Mafalisayo, wanhu wakala womsepa. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Haulongozi ha Yesu hakala na mtamu imwe yavimbile lukuli wose. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu kawauza wafundaji wa shalia na waja Mafalisayo, “Ivo vinoga kumhonya munhu mdizua da kuhumula da hebu havinogile?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Wao wose wanyamala hupii. Baho Yesu kamgoga mkono na kamuhonya, amala kamlongela yaite kumwake. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Amala Yesu kawauza, Yalihi mmwenu kama mwanage hebu ng'ombe wake yahengile mdikombo, honda yamlave mdizua ijo da kuhumula seke yatende hima kumlava hata ihawa mdizua da kuhumula?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Nao hawapatile da kulonga kwa mbuli iyo.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unovu wa kukala kuchisogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu viyawaonile waja wagonekigwe wosagula vigoda va haulongozi kawalongela mfano uo, kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />Kama kulongeligwa wize mdizengele, seke ukale chigoda cha wahenga, manake vodahika kekiligwa mkulu kubita gweye, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />na ihawa io yawalongele mweye mwize mdizengele, kowiza na kukulongela, ‘Segela mchigoda chako yakale muhenga ino.’ Amala gweye koita kukala kuchisogo kwa chinyala. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Mbali wahagonekigwa mdizengele kala vigoda vili kukisogo, ili yaheza ija yakugoneke, yakukeme, ‘Mbwigaangu genda ukale chigoda cha haulongozi ng'hani,’ Baho kopata nhogolwa hawanhu wose wokulola. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Manake chila munhu yoitenda mkulu, kotendigwa mdodo, na iyo yaitendile mdodo kutendigwa iyo mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Amala Yesu kamlongela ija munhu yawagoneke mdizengele, vuuteleka ndia ya imisi hebu ichilo, seke uwagoneke mbwiga zako hebu wayago hebu wayago weli na uzenzi, wahatenda ivo, manake wao wokutendela ivo na gweye, mbuli yokua kama yakuiliha. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Mbali chila vuutanda ndia ya lusona, wakeme ivija na vikumbi muyega, weli na nhale na vipofu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />nagweye komweda kwa vuuwakemile waja vikumbi muyega, kwavija wabule ludabwa wa kukubwelezela, ivo kobwelezeligwa na Mulungu chipindi chonda wazilibuke wanhu watogoligwe.<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa lusona mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayo 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Baho viyahulike gago munhu imwe yakalile na Yesu muindia, kalonga, “Kamweda munhu ija yonda yaje ndia mulusona lwa Ufaume wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu kamwidika, munhu imwe katanda lusona mkulu, kawagoneka wanhu wengi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Chipindi cha lusona vichivikile, iyo munhu kamlagiza mtumigwa wake yakawagoneke waja wose wagonekigwe lusona, ‘Izoni chila chinhu chitandigwa goya!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Mbali waja wanhu chila munhu kasonga kulava masolo, yalongole kalonga mtumigwa, niye nigula mgunda nonda niite kuulola, nokupula seke unihile.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Imwenga nayo ivija kalonga, ‘Nigula ng'ombe walimi jozi tano, nonda niite kuwageza; nokupula seke unihile.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Nayo imwenga kalonga, ‘Niye mhosa mwehe wangu na kwa mbuli io sidaha kwiza.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Ija mtumigwa kabwela kwa mndewa wake na kumlongela, mbuli zose vizili. Baho ija mndewa kagevuzika, kamlagiza ija mtumigwa wake kaidi kamlongela, ‘Lawa hano lopola uite muinzila na mja mvibululu vose va kae, wize nao hano vikumbi muyega na weli na nhale na vipofu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ija mtumigwa kamlongela Mndewa, ‘Gose gaulonga gamala kutendeka kama vuunilagize, ivo ing'hali nyafasi yakukala wanhu muing'anda ya lusona.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Mndewa ija kamlongela mtumigwa wake, lawa hanze uite muinzila na mzimhaka, ukawaseseze weze kwingila mgati kae yangu imeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Manake nowalongela kua, mwa waja wose niwagoneke walema, habule hata munhu imwe honda yailanze ndia yangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viilondeka kua Mwaluko wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37">Matayo 10:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Mabumbila makulu ga Wanhu gakala goita hamwe na Yesu, nayo kagahindukila kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Munhu yoyose yonda kua Mwaluko wangu kolondeka yanigese nie badili ya kuwagesa tati yake hebu mami yake hebu mwehe wake na wanage, hebu na wakulu wake na lumbu zake, enaa, hata ugima wake mwenyego, kama hatendile ivo hadaha kua mwaluko wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Munhu yoyose kama hatogola kudununzika na kufa kwa kuniwinza hadaha kua Mwaluko wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Manake yalihi kumwenu yahalonda kuzenga ng'anda ng'hulu, na seke yakale hasi na kulola goya udahi wake wa sente yeli nazo kumanya kama kodaha kukomeleza kuzenga? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Manake yahazenga ng'anda ya tofali yahapotigwa kukomeleza hausimikilo, baho wanhu wose wamonile viyasongile kuzenga wokwiza kumzeha, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />kwa kulonga, munhu ino kasonga kuzenga, mbali hanakomeleza. <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Tebu nilonge mfano umwenga, ihawa hana Mfaume yoyose, yahalonda kuita miubung'hukila, ‘Ivo hakala hasi na kutonga goya na wanhu wake elufu kumi, kama kodaha kuitowa na ija miage yokwiza na wanhu elufu ishilini? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Na kama yahaona havidaha, nayo kowalagiza Wanhu waite kwa ija yeli na ludabwa mkulu, kumpula mbuli ya kuitogolela kwa utindiwala. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Basi ivija kama munhu yoyose kumwenu kama haleka vose yali navo,” Mchikomelezo Yesu kalonga, “Habule munhu yodaha kua Mwaluko wangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyu izabuke</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Munyu icho chinhu chinogile, mbali ihazabuka, mbali kogela choni ikolele kaidi mbaka inoge? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Haifaya hata muulongo hebu muimboji, mbali yokwasigwa hanze. Ivo yeli na magutwi yavimanye chinilonga.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa bung'hukilalo yagile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Zua dimwe wagoga kodi na weli na malozo wakala waitile kumtegeleza yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mbali Mafalisayo na waja wafunda ndagizi wakala womdeta, munhu ino kowagoneka wanhu weli na malozo, “Ivija kaidi koja nao, <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Baho Yesu kawalongela mfano uno,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Kama Munhu imwe kumwenu yahawa na bung'hukilalo mia amala bung'hukilalo imwe kaga, honda yawaleke waja wamwenga tisini na tisa, amala sekeyaite kuchiwala kuzambwila ija imwe yagile mbaka yamone? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nayo yahamona, kompika mmayega gake kuno kodeng'helela. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Na yahavika ukae yake, kowakema mbwiga zake na ivija wayage na kuwalongela, ‘Chideng'helele hamwe kwa vija nimpata ija bung'hukilalo wangu yagile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Niye nowalongeleni, ivija hokua na deng'o kuulanga kwa Mulungu, kwa munhu imwe yali na malozo yahaleka malozo gake, kubita waja wanhu tisini na tisa wotogoligwa kwa Mulungu na hawagesa kuleka malozo.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa sente yagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesu kagendelela, “Kama muke kana sente kumi za madini ga feza, amala sente imwe yahaga, holeka kumulika na muli kuno yofagila kwa mbuli ya kuizambwila sente yake yagile mbaka aione? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na yahaiona, kowakema mbwiga zake na wayage, na kuwalongela, ‘Deng'heni na niye kwa vija nichipata chija chipande changu chimwe cha madini ga feza chagile!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nowalongela, ivija hokua na deng'o hawatumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kwa mbuli ya munhu imwe yeli na malozo yahaleka malozo gake.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mbwanga yagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Baho Yesu kagendelela kulonga, hakala na muhu imwe yakalile na wabwanga waidi. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Baho ija mdodo kamlongela tati yake, “Tata ning'he uhazi wangu. Tata kabagula amala kamwing'ha vinhu vake. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mchipindi chidodo, mbwanga ija mdo kasola vinhu vave vose kaita isi ya kutali na hamwao, uko kapwililisa vinhu vake vose kwa luhadu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Na viyakomeleze kupwililisa vinhu vose, nzala ng'hulu ingila muisi ija, nayo kasigala kabule chinhu chochose. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Baho mbwanga ija kaita kwa mwenekae imwe kupula sang'hano, iyo mwenekae kamgala mumgunda wake kulisa nguluwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ivo kakala kolonda kuja ndia iyoja nguluwe mbali habule munhu yamwing'ile ndiya yoyose. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Mbali viyatongile mmoyo wake, kailongela, “Kwa tati yangu hana watumigwa wengi woja ndiya na kusigaza habali niye nidanganike na nzala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nobwela kwa tati yangu na kumlongela, “Tata nhenda malozo kumwako na kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Silondeka kukemigwa mwanago kaidi, mbali unhende kama imwe mwa watumigwa wako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ivo kasegela kubwela kwa tati yake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Mbali viyakalile kutali mnzila, tati yake kamona na kumonela bazi, tataake kamkimbilila kumhagatila na kumlamsa. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mbwanga ija kamlongela tataake, ‘Nhenda malozo kumwako na kuulanga kwa Mulungu, silondeka kukemigwa mwanago kaidi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Mbali tati yake kawalagiza watumigwa wake, ‘Lopoleni, ‘Ngalileni valo dinogile, mumvaze, na kumumvaze mhete mchidole chake na mumvaze vilatu mmagulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Amala kasoleni bofu da ng'ombe yanonile mumchinje, chije na chitende lusona. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwa vija mwanangu ino kakala kama munhu yadanganike, nayo sambi mgima, kakala yagile, sambi nayo kaoneka.’ Baho wasonga kudeng'helela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Chipindi icho ija mbwanga mkulu kakala kumgunda, viyavikilile habehi na ukae, kahulika dizi da nyila kuno wanhu wovina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kamkema mtumigwa imwe kamuuza, choni chigendelela hano? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Iyo mtumigwa kamlongela, mdodo wako keza, labaho na tati yako kamchinjila bofu da ng'ombe yanonile kwa vija mwanage kabwela ukae yeli mgima. <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Ija mkulu wake kehiligwa, na kalema hata kwingila mng'anda. Baho tati yake kalwa kunze na kumpula ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Mbali iyo mbwanga kamwidika tati yake kamlongela, ‘Tata lola, niye nikala nikusang'hanila milao mingi, hata zua dimwe sinaleka kuzitogola ndagizi zako, na hunaning'ha hata mbuzi imwe mhate kudeng'helela na mbwiza zangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Mbali viyezile ino mwanago yapwililise vinhu na weli na luhadu, gweye kumchinjila ndama yanonile! <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tati yake kamlongela, ‘Go mwana, gweye kukala na niye mazua gose, na vinhu vino vose nili navo ni vako ivija. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Chilondeke kutendigwa ni kuvina na kudeng'helela kwa vija mdodo wako yakalile kadanganika sambi mgima, na yakalile kaga sambi kaoneka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa Mnyapala mbala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu kawalongela Waluko wake, “Hakala na Munhu imwe mzenzi, na yakalile na mnyapala wake, munhu ino kapatika na mbuli ya kupwililisa vinhu va mdewa wake. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Zua dimwe mndewa mzenzi kamkema na kamuuza, ‘Mbuli gani zino zinihulika zokulonga gweye? Mhetele idadi ya vinhu vangu, kwa vija havidahika gweye kugendelela kua mnyapala.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ija mnyapala kaiuza mmoyo wake, ‘Sambi notendaze? Manake mzenzi wangu koniwinga unyapala wangu. Na kulima sidaha, na ivija kupula noona chinyala. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mbali novimanya va kusang'hana, ili vonda nilavigwe muunyapala, wanhu wadahe kunibokela mzikae zao. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Kawakema waja wanhu wodaigwa na mzenzi wake, na kuwauza chila munhu, ‘Ivo sente nyingahi zuulondeka kumliha mzenzi wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ija munhu kalonga, vidumu mia saba alubaini va mavuta ga mzaituni, ija mnyapala kamlongela, sola kalatasi yako ya chuulondeka kuliha, amala kala hasi, yandika mia nhatu na sabini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Amala kamuuza ija munhu wa kaidi, na gweye kolondeka kuliha sente nyingahi? kedika magunia mia mbili ga ngano. Ija mnyapala kamlongela ivija, sola kalatasi yako, yandika magunia mia moja na sitini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ija mzenzi kamtogola nyapala mbala kwa vija viyatendile kwa nzewele, manake wanhu wa ulelo uno wokua na ubala ng'hani wakuisang'hanila mbuli zao mbali wanhu womuwinza Mulungu wabule ubala uo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Na niye nowalongela, “Muisang'hanile ubwiga kwa vinhu va muuisi, ili vahaga Mulungu yawabokele muugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Munhu yotogoligwa kwa vinhu vidodo ng'hani, kotogoligwa kwa mbuli ng'hulu ivija, na munhu hotogoligwa vinhu vidodo, iyo hatogoligwa hata kwa vinhu vikulu ivija. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Baho kama mweye hamuwile wakutogoligwa muuzenzi wa muuisi, yelihi yonda yaweng'he mweye uo unzenzi unogile? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ivija kama hamwile wanhu wakutogoligwa kwa vinhu va munhu imwenga, yelihi yonda yaweng'he vinhu venu wenyego?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Habule mtumigwa yonda yawasang'hanila wandewa waidi ng'o! Manake hebu komwihila ino na kukala na wende na ija, hebu koilumba na ija na kumzeleu ino. Havidahaika kumsang'hanila Mulungu na uzenzi vose hamwe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahala gamwenga ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Matayo 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Maluko 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mbali Mafalisayo kwavija wenyego wakala wozilonda sente ng'hani viwahulike gago, wamzeha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, mweye iyo wanhu moigoda kua motenda goya hawanhu, mbali Mulungu kawamanya mmioyo yenu. Manake vija vinhu vitogoligwa ng'hani na wanhu kwa Mulungu viha.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Ndagizi za Musa na mayandiko ya walagusi wa Mulungu vikala voliguligwa mbaka viyezile Yohana Mbatizi, kulawa baho Ufaume wa Mulungu wofundigwa, ivo chila munhu kokwingila kwa ludabwa muufaume uo. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Mbali ibuha ng'hani ulanga na isi kuhalawa kubita hata helufi imwe ilawe muindagizi.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Munhu yoyose yomleka mwehe wake na kusola mwehe imwenga iyo kutenda ugoni, nayo mulume yomsola mwehe ija yalekigwe na mulume wake iyo munhu kotenda ugoni ivija.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu mzenzi na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesu kalonga, hakala na munhu imwe yali na uzenzi ng'hani, yavalile vivalo va langi zambalau zikalile za bei ng'hulu, na mazua gose kakala koja kwa luhadu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Baho haulwivi hakala na chikumbi muyega imwe, zina jake Lazalo, yeli na vilonda vingi, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lazalo kakala kotumanila ndia ilagale kulawa muimeza ya ija mzenzi, hata umbwa weza na kuvilambita vilonda vake.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Ija chikumbi muyega viyadanganike, kasoligwa na mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wamwika habehi na Ibulahimu. Na ija mzenzi ivija kadanganika na wamuwanda. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Basi ija mzenzi viyakalile kuja kwa wanhu wafile kuno yodununzika, kenula meso gake kamuona Ibulahimu na ija Lazalo kahabehi yake. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Baho ija mzenzi kalila, kalonga, ‘Tata Ibulahimu nionele bazi, mlagize Lazalo yazabike chidole chake mgamazi amala yahoze lulimi lwangu, kwa vija nodununzika muumoto uno hano hanili.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Mbali Ibulahimu kamlongela, ‘Mwanangu sekeuisemwe kua gweye kukala kopata vinhu vinogile muugima wako, nayo Lazalo kakala yopata gehile, ivo sambi nayo Lazalo kahano kohumula na gweye kodununzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Na kulu kubita gose, hagati yetu cheye na mweye hana kombo kulu, kwa mbuli ya waja wanhu wolonda kulawa kumwetu kwiza kumwenu wapotigwe, na waja wolonda kulawa kumwenu kwiza kumwetu ivija wapotigwe kwiza. <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Mzenzi iyo kalonga, ‘Tata nokupula mlagize Lazalo yaite ukae kwa walukolo wangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kwa vija hana walukolo wangu watano yawakomhokele ili nao seke wavike hanhu hano ivija ha madununzo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Ibulahimu kamwidika, ‘Wao wahamwe na Musa na Walagusi wa Mulungu, ivo wolondeka kuwategeleza wao.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />“Mbali ija mzenzi kalonga, ‘Sio ivo Tata Ibulahimu, mbali kama munhu yahalawa kwa wafile yahaita kumwao, nao woleka malozo na kumfugamila Mulungu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ibulahimu kawalongela, kama hawalonda kuwatogola Musa na Walagusi wa Mulungu, hawadaha kutogola mbe hata munhu yahalawa kwa wafile hawamtegeleza.<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Mahala ga malozo na kugela kumgongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6">Matayo 18:6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maluko 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Amala Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, haidahika kabisa sekezilawilile ng'walo zigala malozo, mbali koluona munhu ija yogala ng'walo! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Yofaa ng'hani munhu iyo yafungiligwe dimwe kulu da kudundila muisingo yake, na kwasigwa muibahali. Kuliko kumwing'ha ng'walo mwana mdodo mwa wana wano. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Kwaivo itiganyeni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Miago yahatenda malozo, mkomhokele, yahalonga na kuleka malozo, gela kumgongo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Na mdizua dimwe yahakuhasanya mala saba na kwiza kumwako mala saba ivija na, ‘Yahalonga na kuleka malozo,’ Gwee gela kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumanilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Wasenga wa Mulungu wamlongela Mndewa, “Chongezele tumanilo.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Mndewa Yesu kedika, “Kama mwahawile na tumanilo dodo kama mhule ya haladali, mwahadahile kuulongela umbiki wa mkuyu, lawa ukaihande muibahali,’ nao uhatogole.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumigwa viyalondeka kusang'hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Chilonge hana munhu imwe mmwenu kana mlimi hebu msusilaji bung'hukilalo. Ivo yahabwela kulawa kuchiwala mndewa wake kodaha kumlongela, ‘Lopola kala uje ndia?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Baho havidahika, mbali komlongela, ‘Nhandile ndia, na nikile nije na kung'wa amala nagweye leka uje na kung'wa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ivo, komwing'ha hewela mtumigwa wake kwavija kasang'hana kama viyalagizigwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ivija mhasang'hana gose gamlagizigwe, longeni, ‘Cheye watumigwa tu chilibule nhogolwa, chosang'hana gaja gachilondeke kusang'hana.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya weli na dikulu kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu viyakalile muumwanza kuita Yelusalemu, kobitila mzimhaka za isi ya Samalia na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Na viyakalile yokwingila mchijiji chimwe, kaiting'hanila na wanhu kumi weli na dikulu, wema kutali nayo. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Wenula dizi kulu walonga, “Gweye Yesu Mfundaji, chionele bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Viyawonile kawalongela, “Gendeni mkilaguse kwa Walava nhambiko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Ivo viwakalile woita uko wahona na kutogoligwa kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Nayo munhu imwe mmwao viyaonile kua kahona kabwela, kuno yomtogola Mulungu kwa dizi kulu, <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />kagwa chifudifudi mmagulu ga Yesu,’ na kumwing'ha hewela Yesu. Munhu iyo kakala Msamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu kalonga, “Ivo, hamkalile kumi niwahonyile na kupata chibali cha kutogoligwa kumfugamila Mulungu? Waja tisa wa kulihi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Habule yoyose yabwelile kumtogola Mulungu ila ino nyambenyambe?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Amala Yesu kamlongea, “Ima ugende, tumanilo uli nayo dikuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa ufaume wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Chipindi chimwe Mafalisayo wamuuza Yesu,“Ufaume wa Mulungu wokwiza lini?” Nayo kawalongela ufaume wa Mulungu hawiza kwa nzila ya kuulolesa. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ivija habule yonda kulonga, ‘Wakuno hebu ‘Wakuja.’ Kweli ufaume wa Mulungu wammwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Amala Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Chipindi chokwiza molonda kuona zua dimwe tu da nie Mwanage Munhu na hamuiona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ivija wanhu wowalongela, ‘Loleni kakuja! Hebu ‘Loleni kahano!’ Mbali mweye sekemlawe hebu kuwawinza. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwa vija nie Mwanage Munhu mdizua jangu nokwiza kama lumwesa lwa ladi, ubung'hule kuulanga kulawa mhande imwe kuita kumwenga, ivo vondaili nie Mwanage Munhu mdizua ijo. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Mbali kolondeka Mwanage Munhu kudununzika ng'hani, ivija na kulemigwa na wanhu wa ulelo uno.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />“Kama viili mmazua ga Nuhu, vivo vonda iwe mdizua jangu nie Mwanage Munhu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Msimo uo wa Nuhu wanhu wakala woja na wong'wa na kusola na kusoligwa mbaka zua dija Nuhu viyengile Muingalawa ng'hulu, Mvula kulu itoa na bung'hukila da mazi kuwakoma wanhu wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ivo ikalile mdizua da Lutu, Wanhu wakala woja na kung'wa, na kuigulila, na kuhanda na kuzenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Mbali zua dija Lutu viyasegele kulawa Sodoma, moto wa chibeliti upwililika kama mvula kuwakoma wanhu na vinhu vose. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ivo vonda iwe mdizua ijo vija nie Mwanage Munhu nihalawilila.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Mdazua ijo, Munhu yoyose yonda yawe hachanha haing'anda yake, sekeyahulumuke na kuita kusola via vake, ivija na ija yakalile kumgunda sekeyabwele ukae kusola chochose. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Seke muisemwe ija mbuli ya mwehe wa Loti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Munhu yoyose yonda yageze kuuhonya ugima wake, kowagiza, na munhu yokwagiza ugima wake kouhonya. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nowalongeleni, chilo icho wanhu waidi wakala wawasa mdikomwa dimwe, munhu imwe kosoligwa na imwenga kolekigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Wanachike waidi wokua wodunda ndia mdibwe, imwe kosoligwa na imwenga kolekigwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Walume waidi wokua wosang'hana kumgunda, munhu imwe kosoligwa na io imwengwa kolekigwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Waluko wake wamuuza, “Halihi Mndewa?” Yesu kawalongela, “Haja hali na mtufi, baho honda waikunzanyile mkwangule.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa muke mgane na mlamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Amala Yesu kawalongela waluko wake mfano umwe kalonga, vija viilondeka kumpula Mulungu mazua gose bila kulegela. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Amala kalonga, “Muikae imwe hakala na mlamuzi imwe, kakala bila kumfugamila Mulungu hebu kuwagesa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Muikae iija hakala na muke imwe mgane yakalile yomgendela mlamuzi iyo mala nyingi kuno yompula yolonga, ‘Ngombele mhate chibali cha uhumi kulawa kwa mhasanyi wangu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Mmazua mengi mlamuzi iyo halondile kumgombela iyo mgane, mbali mchikomelezo mlamuzi kailongela, ‘Hata kama nie simfugamila Mulungu na siwagesa wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />mbali mgane ino konigaza ng'hani, ivo nomgombela ili yapate chibali cha uhumi. Ama kogendelela kwiza kumwangu mala zose mbaka nolegela kabisa!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Amala Mndewa kalonga, ‘Gatongeni ng'hani gaja gayalongile iyo mlamuzi msede. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ivo, Mulungu hodaha kuwagombela waja yawasagule, womlilila misi na chilo yawataze? Ivo, baho iyo kokawa kuwataza? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nowalongeleni, iyo kolopola kuwagombela wapate chibali cha uhumi. Hataivo, nie Mwanage Munhu niheza nodivika tumanilo muiisi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa Mfalisayo na mgoga kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Baho Yesu kawalongela mfano umwe waja wanhu watongile kua wao weli na unovu wa Mulungu, kuno wowazeleu wamwenga. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Zua dimwe wanhu waidi waita kumfugamila Mulungu Muikae ya Mulungu, imwe kakala mgoga kodi na imwenga kakala Mfalisayo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ija Falisayo kema kuno yompula Mulungu yolonga mmoyo, ‘Go Mulungu niye nokutogola kwa vija niye sio kama wanhu wamwenga, wanhu weli na wamelo, wavwizi na wagoni, hebu kama ino mgoga kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Niye mdijuma sija mazua maidi kuno nompula Mulungu na nomlavila fungu dimwe da nhosa mmafungu kumi ga uzenzi wangu.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Mbali ija mgoga kodi kema kutali, na henule meso gake kuulanga mbali kakala yoitoa muimhambaga kwa giogio na kolonga, ‘Go Mulungu nionele bazi nie nili na malozo.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Niye nowalongeleni, “Ija mgoga kodi kabwela ukae yake kuno kalekeseligwa malozo gake. Mbali ija miage halekeseligwe. Kwavija yoinula kohulumusigwa na yotumbala kokwinuligwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha unovu wa Mulungu wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Wanhu wakala womgalila Yesu wanawadodo yawekile makono gake ili yaweng'he unovu wa Mulungu. Mbali waluko wake viwaonile ivo, wawakomhokela, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />mbali Yesu kawakema waja wana wadodo waite kumwake kalonga, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu, seke muwakimile, kwa vija Ufaume wa Mulungu ulinga wanhu kama wao. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Kweli nowalongeleni, munhu yoyose yolema kuubokela Ufaume wa Mulungu kama mwana mdodo hokwingila ng'o Muufaume Wamulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlongozi mzenzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Amala mlongozi imwe Muyahudi kamuuza Yesu, “Mfundaji uli nawende, choni chinilondeka kusang'hana mbaka mhate ugima ulibule uhelelo?<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Baho Yesu kamwidika, “Habali kong'hema niye munhu nili na wende? “Habule munhu yoyose yali na wende, mbali Mulungu yaiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Gweye kozimanya ndagizi za Mulungu, ‘Seke utende ugoni na seke ukome ivija seke wibe na kwa mbuli ya miago seke ulonge uvwizi kwa wanhu, mbali wategeleze tata yako na mami yako.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Nayo kamlongela, “Gago gose nigamanya kulawa hadodo wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu viyehulike mbuli izo kamlongela, “Gweye kuhungukiligwa na mbuli imwe. Kule vinhu vako vose ulinavo, amala kawagolele vikumbi muyega baho kokua na mhamba kuulanga amala izo uniwinze. <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Viyehulike mbuli iyo kagwa giogio kwa vija kakala na uzenzi mkulu.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu viyamonile munhu iyo viyatendile, baho kalonga, “Loleni viili ndala kwa munhu mzenzi kwingila Muufaume wa Mulungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Mbali vibuha ng'hani kwa mnyama ngamia kwingila mdizonzo da sindano kubita mzenzi kwingila Muufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Waja wanhu waulike ulonzi uo wauza, “Kama ndala ivo, yelihi yodaha kuhonyigwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu kawedika, “Gaja gose hagadahika kwa wanhu, kwa Mulungu godahika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Amala Petulo kamlongela Yesu, “Lola, na cheye chileka vinhu vetu vose chikuwinza gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu kalonga,”kweli nowalongeleni, habule hata munhu imwe yailekile kae yake hebu muke wake hebu waukae hebu tata na mami yake hebu wanage kwa mbuli ya Ufaume wa Mulungu <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />amala seke yabokele vingi ng'hani chipindi chino na ugima ulibule uhelelo muiisi iyo ikwiza.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagusa mala ya kadatu mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu kawasola hamgwazo waja waluko wake kumi na waidi na kawalongela, “Chokwela kuita Yelusalemu na chila chinhu chandikigwe na walagusi wa Mulungu kwa mbuli ya Mwana wa munhu chovikila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwa vija Mwana wa Munhu kogaligwa kwa wamhazi, na womzeha na kumliga na kumtemela mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Nao womtoa mbalati na kumkoma, na mdizua da kadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Mbali waluko wake hawazimanyile mbuli izo, kwa vija umanyi wa mbuli izo ufisigwa kumwao, baho hawamanyile choni chilongigwe na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya chipofu mpulaji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu viyakalile behi na isi ya Yeliko, munhu imwe chipofu, kakala yakalile mnzila kuno yopula. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Chipofu iyo viyehulike bumbila da wanhu dobita kauza, “Kuna choni?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Wamlongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti kobita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Baho chipofu iyo kenula dizi kalonga, “Yesu! Mwanage Daudi! unionele bazi! <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Waja wakalile haulongozi hake wamkomhokela ili yanyamale. Mbali hatogole na kongeza kwinula dizi, “Mwanage Daudi! unionele bazi!.”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu kema na kuwalagiza wamgale kumwake, na viyavikile habehi, Yesu kamuuza,<verse eid="LUK 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Kolonda nikutendele choni?” Kedika “Mndewa, nolonda nilole.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu kamlongela, “Haya ulole! Tumanilo jako dikuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Bahaja kalola na kamuwinza Yesu, na kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu. Na wanhu wose viwaonile mbuli izo, wose wamtogola Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Nayo Yesu kengila Yeliko kakala yobita mzinzila za kae iyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Baho hakala na munhu imwe mkulu wa wagoga kodi kokemigwa Zakayo, nayo kakala mzenzi. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nayo Zakayo kakala kolonda kumona Yesu kuwa munhu yeli vilihi, kwa ivo kapotigwa kumona Yesu kwa vija kakala mguhi na hakala na bumbila da wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ivo kakimbila hima kuulongozi mwa bumbila da wanhu na kakwela kuchanha mwa mkuyu yadahe kumona Yesu, kwa vija Yesu kakala yobitila nzila ija. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Basi Yesu viyavikile haja ha mkuyu, kalola kuchanha kamlongela Zakayo, “Lopola hulumuka, kwa vija lelo kokua mwenekae wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Baho Zakayo kahulumuka hima na kamgoneka Yesu ukae yake kwa deng'o. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Wanhu wose viwaonile mbuli iyo, wehiligwa na kulonga, “Kengila kwa mwenekae yeli na malozo.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Mbali Zakayo kema na kumlongela Mndewa, “Tegeleza Mndewa! Fungu dimwe mmafungu gangu maidi ga uzenzi wangu noweng'ha vikumbi muyega, na kama nimboka chinhu munhu yoyose, nombwelezela mala kane ya chinimbokile.<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Amala Yesu kamlongela Zakayo, “Lelo kae ino muloholigwa kwa vija ino nayo ni Mwana wa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="LUK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwa vija nie Mwana wa Munhu niza kuzambwila na kulohola chija chagile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa watumigwa kumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Waja wanhu viwakalile womtegeleza Yesu, watonga kua Ufaume wa Mungu wa habehi kulawila, kwa vija wakala habehi kuvika Yelusalemu. Baho Yesu kawalongela mfano uno. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />“Hakala na munhu imwe wa lukolo lwa Kifaume, kaita isi ya kutali ili yasimikigwe kua Mfaume, amala yahasimikigwa yabwele ukae yake. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Kabula hanasegela kawakema watumigwa wake kumi na kamwing'ha sente chila munhu, kawalongela, ‘Mzisang'hanile sang'hano zimeme mbaka nihabwela.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Mbali wanhu wa isi yake wamwihila na wagala usenga na walonga, ‘Hachimlonda munhu ino yawe Mfaume wetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Hata ivo munhu iyo kasimikigwa ukulu na kabwela kumwake yeli mfaume. Ivo kawakema waja watumigwa wake yaweng'ile sente, ili yavimanye zongezeka sente nyingahi kwa chila munhu. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wa mosi keza na kalonga, ‘Mndewa, kwa gaja mafungu gauning'ile gongezeka mafungu gamwenga kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mndewa kalonga, ‘Kusang'hana goya,’ ‘Gweye kwa mtumigwa unogile! kwa vija kukala munhu wa kutogoligwa vinhu vidodo, nokwing'ha ukulu mzikae kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Wa kaidi nayo keza na kulonga, ‘Mndewa, kwa gaja mafungu gauning'ile mhata mafungu matano gamwenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Na ino wa kaidi kamlongela, ‘Nokwing'ha ukulu mzikae tano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Amala keza ija mtumigwa imwenga na kalonga, ‘Mndewa dino hano fungu jako, kwa vija nikala niifisile goya muifundo ya msuli wangu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nikudumba kwa vija nikumanya gweye hubunzwaga. Kosola chinhu sichako, na kokwaha chinhu huchihandile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mndewa kamlongela, ‘Gweye mtumigwa wihile! Kolamuligwa kwa ulonzi wako mwenyego! Kunimanya kua niye sibunzwaga, nosola chinhu sichangu na ivija nokwaha sichihandile. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Vinoga, ivo habali huzigalile sente zangu kwa wanhu wa kuzisang'hanila sang'hano! Amala nahabwela mhate fungu jangu na dija fungu jongezeke.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Baho kawalongela waja wemile habehi, ‘Mbokeni sente yeli nayo na mwing'heni ija mtumigwa yeli na sente kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Mbali wamlongela, ‘Mndewa iyo tiyali kana sente kumi! <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Mndewa kedika, ‘Nomlongeleni’ ‘Munhu yeli na chinhu, hata yahawa na vingi kokwing'higwa, mbali yelibule chinhu hata chidodo yelinacho kobokigwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ivija na waja wahasanyi wangu, waja hawalonda niwe Mfaume wao, wagaleni hano muwakome kuno nowalola!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa ndeng'helelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kalongoza nzila kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Nayo viyavikile behi na Betifage na Betania mchigongo cha mizeituni, kawalagiza waluko wake waidi walongole <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />na malagizo gano, “Gendeni mchijiji chija mchiona, muheingila, momona mwana wa mhunda kafungigwa na hanampapa munhu. Mfuguleni na mumgale hano. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Na kama munhu yahawauza habali momfungula? Mulongeleni Mndewa komlonda.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Na waja watumigwe viwaitile kuja, wavika chila chinhu kama vija Yesu viyalongile. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Viwakalile womfugula mwana mhunda, wenyego wawauza, “Habali momfugula iyo mhunda?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Wao wedika, “Mndewa komlonda, <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />na wamgalila Yesu mwana mhunda. Amala watandika vivalo vao mumgongo mwa mhunda na baho mhunda kampapa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Na Yesu viyakalile koita kuno kakwela mwana mhunda, wanhu waviyanzanza vivalo vao mnzila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Na viyavikile behi na Yelusalemu, mchigongo cha Mizeituni, bumbila da wajalusona wake, wasonga kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu na kumtogola kwa dizi kulu, kwa mbuli ya miuzonza yose iwaonile, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Walonga, “Kamweda iyo Mfaume yokwiza kwa Zina da Mndewa! Utindiwala ukale kuulanga kwa Mulungu na ukulu kuchna ng'hani kwa Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Amala Mafalisayo wamwenga wakalile mdibumbila wamlongela Yesu. “Mfundaji, “Wakomhokele waluko wako wanyamale hupi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongeleni wano wahanyamala, mabwe genyego gosonga kuguta nyangi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koililila kae ya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yesu viyavikile behi na Yelusalemu na kuiona kae kaililila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />kuno yolonga, “Maza uhavimanyile lelo choni chilondeka kwa utindiwala! Mbali sambi gafisigwa mmeso gako! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwa vija zua dokwiza, baho wahasanyi wako wonda wakuzunguluke na kukusunha kulawa mhande zose. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Wokulagaza hasi, gweye na wanago ulinao. Hawakulekela hata dibwe donda disigale mdibwe dimwenga, kwavija kukala ulema kuvimanya chipindi chija Mulungu yokugalila ulohozi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kengila mui ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Amala Yesu kengila mui ng'anda ya Mulungu, na kasonga kuwawinga waja wakalile wogula vinhu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />kawalongela, “Yandikigwa mmayandiko, ‘Ng'anda yangu ni ng'anda ya kumpula Mulungu.’ Mbali mweye muihindula kua mhango ya wabavi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Chila zua Yesu kakala yofunda mui ng'anda ya Mulungu. Mkulu wa walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi na Vilongozi wa wanhu wakala wolonda kumkoma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />mbali hawapatile nyafasi ya kutenda diwalondile, kwa vija wanhu wose wakala womtegeleza goya na hawalondile hata mbuli imwe iwabite.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Wauza mbuli ya udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Zua dimwe, Yesu viyakalile yofunda wanhu mui ng'anda ya Mulungu mbuli ya usenga unogile, Vilongozi wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi na wavele vilongozi weza <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />na wamuuza, “Chilongele gweye kosang'na mbuli zino kwa kwa udaho ulihi? Na yalihi yakudahize?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Tanhu leka nie niwauze. Nogeleni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />udaho wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu hebu ulawa kwa wanhu?<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Mbali wao wailongela wenyego kwa wenyego, “Chomlongela choni? Chihalonga, ‘Ulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu,’ Kochilongela, ‘Ivo habali hamumtogole?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Mbali chahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’ dino bumbila jose dili hano dochitoa kwa mabwe, kwa vija wamtogola kua Yohana kakala Mlagusi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Baho wamwidika, “Hachimanyile kuulawile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nanie siwalongela, nosang'hana gano kwa udaho ulihi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa wazima mgunda wa zabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Amala Yesu kawalongela wanhu mfano uno, “Hakala na munhu imwe yahandile mizabibu mumgunda wake, ivo kawazima walimi amala kapata mwanza kahalawa kwa chipindi chitali. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Msimo wa mlao vuuvikile, kamlagiza mtumwa wake yaite kwa waja wazime mgunda yakasole manhunda kulawa mumgunda wa zabibu. Mbali waja wazime mgunda wamtoa ija mtumwa na kabwela bila chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Baho ija Mndewa kamlagiza mtumigwa wake imwenga, na mtumwa iyo nayo wamtoa ivija, na wamgela chinyala, na kabwela bila chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Baho kamlagiza mtumwa wa kadatu, na ino ivija wamlumiza ng'hani na wamwasa kunze. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Amala ija mndewa yeli na umgunda kaiuza, ‘Nhendeze niye? Nokwiza kumlagiza mwanangu yaiyeka nili na wende nayo, mmanye ino wokwiza kumtegeleza!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Mbali waja wazime mgunda viwamonile mwana iyo, wailongela wenyego, ‘Ino iyo mwana mndewa iyo yeli na uhazi wa mgunda. Na chimkome na uhazi wake wokua wetu!’<verse eid="LUK 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Amala wamlava hamgwazo hamgunda wa mizabebu na baho wamkoma. “Yesu kawauza, “Mmane mwenemgundakowatendaze waja walimi?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“Kokwiza kuwakoma walimi wose, na koweng'ha wanhu wamwenga mgunda uo wa mizebibu.” Wanhu viwahulke gano walolonga, “Habule seke galawilile gago!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Mbali Yesu kawalola kwa kuwagangamizila meso gake na kulonga, “Yandiko dino manake choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Dibwe dilemigwe na wazengaji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">ijo diwa dibwe kulu da kutumanila da hamgwazo dakuzengela ng'anda.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Munhu yoyose yogwa mdibwe ijo kobeneka vihande vihande, na ivija dibwe ijo dihamgwila munhu, iyo munhu domhonda honda na kua kama usage.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wouza mbuli ya kuliha kodi kwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Nao wafunda ndagizi na wakulu wa nhambiko wageza kumgoga Yesu bahaja, kwa vija wavimanya mfano uja uwalonga wao, mbali wawadumba wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Kwaivo wakala wozambwila nyafasi inogile ya kumgoga. Ivo walagiza vibilikizi waitende kama wanoga kwa Yesu ili wamwamhe kwa mbuli zake ziyalonga na kumgala mwa wakulu wa silikali ya Walumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Baho waja vibilikizii wamuuza Yesu, “Mfundaji, chivimanya kua kolonga na kofunda mbuli zitogoligwa. Na humbagula munhu kwa vovose viyeli, mbali kofunda nzila ya Mulungu ya ukweli. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tebu chilongele kama cheye cholondeka kumliha kodi Kaisali hebu hachilondeka?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Mbali Yesu kaumanya ubala wao, baho kawauza, mweye habali monigeza, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ndagusileni sente. Chihanga chino chanani na mayandiko gano ga nani?” Wamwidika, “Ga Kaisali Mfaume mkulu wa Loma.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Vinoga, mliheni Kaisali vija va Kaisali, na mwing'heni Mulungu vija va Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Baho wapotigwa kumgela mmakono kwa mbuli zija yazilongile hawanhu. Ivo wanyamala hupi, wakanganyigwa kwa ulonzi wake.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wouza mbuli ya Uzilibuko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Amala Masadukayo wamwenga, waja wolonga kua habule uzilibuko wa wafile, weza kwa Yesu na kumuuza, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Go mfundaji, Musa kachandikila ndagizi ino, ‘Kama munhu yahadanganika na kumleka mwehe wake bila mwana, kolondeka mkulu wake yamuhazi mgane iyo ili yamlelele wana ija mdodo wake yadanganike bila mwana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ivo hakala na wanhu saba wa tata imwe, imkulu kasola mwehe na kadanganika bila mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Amala magati kamhazi mgane yalekigwe na mkulu wake, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Na chibule nayo ivija. Ivo vilawilile kwa waja wose saba wadanganika bila kuleka wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Mchikomelezo, na iyo muke ivija kadanganika. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ivo basi, mdizua da uzilibuko, iyo muke kokua mwehe wa yelihi? Kwavija kakala yasoligwe na walume wose saba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu kawedika, “Wanhu wa chipindi chino wasola na kusoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />mbali kwa waja wonda yawaone wolondeka wapate nyafasi ya ugima muuzilibuko chipindi icho hawasola hebu kusoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Wao wokua kama watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu, wao wanage Mulungu, weng'higwa nyafasi ya ugima kaidi, kwavija wao wana wa uzilibuko. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Musa ivija kagangamiza kua wafile wozilibuka. Kwa mbuli ya chija chisaka chikalile chokwaka moto bila kumala na kakala kolonga na Mndewa kama ‘Mulungu wa Ibulahimu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Iyo Mulungu wa wagima, sio Mulungu wa wafile, manake wokala kumwake wose wana ugima.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wafunda ndagizi wamwenga walonga, “Go mfundaji, kulonga goya!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Viwakomeleze baho, hawagezile kumuuza mbuli zimwenga kaidi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito Mwanage nani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Amala Yesu kawauza, “Wolongaze kua Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu mwanage Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Manake Daudi mwenyego kolonga mchitabau cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Mndewa kamlongela, Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Kala ubanzi wangu wa nhogolwa,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbaka vonda niwatende wahasanyi wako kua chigoda cha kwikila magulu gako.<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Kama Daudi komkema ‘Mndewa,’ yokuwaze kaidi Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu kua ulelo wa Daudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muitiganye na wafunda ndagizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Wanhu wose viwakalile womtegeleza, Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Itiganyeni na wanda ndagizi za Musa, wenyego wotenda nhogolwa kugenda kuno wavala ng'hanzu nhali ivija wolonda wawalamse wanhu mmasoko, wao wokala mvigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila wayahudi, na husola nyafasi za watogoligwe mulusona, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />wowasolela wagane vinhu vao kuno woitenda wanoga na woigoda kupula kwa chipindi chitali! Wanhu kama wano wokwing'higwa nyinukila ng'hulu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Nhosa ya muke mgane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maluko 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu viyakalile mui ng'anda ya Mulungu kawaona wazenzi viwakalile wolava nhosa mchia chakulavila nhosa. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ivija kamona mwanchike imwe mgane yeli chikumbi muyega, keka nhosa ya sente mbili mchia chija. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Baho Yesu kalonga, “Nomlongeleni kweli, ino mgane chikumbi muyega kalava hakulu kubita wamwenga wose. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Manake wanhu waja wamwenga walava nhosa ija isigale kulawa muuzenzi wao, mbali ino mgane yeli chikumbi muyega kalava sente ya ngama yelinavo muugima wake.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulaguzi vija vonda ibanangigwe ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Baho waluko wamwenga wakala wolongelela mbuli za ng'anda ya Mulungu, viihambigwe goya kwa mabwe ga bei ng'hulu kubitila nhosa za wanhu wazilavile kwa Mulungu. Mbali Yesu kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />kwa mbuli zino mzilola, chipindi chokwiza habule hata dibwe dimwe donda disigale mdibwe dimwengwa, chila dibwe dobanangika.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilaguso cha zua da uhelelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Wamuuza, “Mfundaji,” Lini zolawilila mbuli zino? Na choni chonda chilaguse kua chipindi chakulawilila mbuli zino cha habehi?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu kawalongela, “Muitiganye seke mvwiziligwe. Kwavija wengi wolawila na kutumila zina jangu, nakulonga, ‘Iyo nie!’ Na kaidi, ‘Chipindi icho chahabehi.’ Mbali mweye seke muwawinze. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Seke mdumbe muhahulika bung'hukila na mahasanyo, mbuli izo zolondeka zisonge kulawilila, mbali hailagusa kua uhelelo wa vose uvika.<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Wanhu wa isi imwe woitoa na wanhu wa isi imwenga na ivija wanhu wa ufaume umwe woitoa na wanhu wa ufaume umwenga. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Mbali hokua na migudemo mikulu muuisi, nzala na vitamu va chila namna va kuilokeza, kolawila bung'hukila ng'hulu kuchana kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Mbali kabula ya gano gose haganalawilila, mweye mogeligwa mmakono, na wowadununza, wowagela mzikae za kuitinganila na kuwagela mmageleza, mogaligwa mwa wafaume na vilongozi kwambuli ya kuniwinza. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Na ino yokua nyafasi yako ya kuligula Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mbali mchipindi icho seke mgae, choni chakulonga kuikimila, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kwa vija niye mwenyego noweng'ha chakulonga na nzewele ija habule hata imwe mwa wahasanyi wenu yonda yeme na kubela gamlonga. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Na mweye mohindukigwa hata na tata na mami zetu na ndugu zenu na mbwiga zenu na wayenu, wamwenga wenu wokomigwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Chila munhu kowehila kwambuli ya kuniwinza. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Mbali habule honda mpate dihile jojose. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Na mweye mwahafunya moyo mouhonya ugima wenu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula kubanangigwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maluko 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Mbali mwahaona kae ya Yelusalemu izungukiligwa na wamilizi, baho mvimanye ubananzi wa habehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Amala waja wanhu wali Yuda wakimilile mvigongo, waja weli muikae ya Yelusalemu walawe, na waja wali mmigunda seke wabwele muikae. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwa vija mmazua gago hokua 'Zua da nyinukila,’ kulagusa kua kweli gaja gose gandikigwe mmayandiko. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Woluona weli na inda na waja weli na ving'hele! Kwavija holawila madununzo makulu muisi, na nyinukila ya Mulungu yowagwila wanhu wa isi ya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Wamwenga wokomigwa kwa panga, na wamwenga wosoligwa kama wafungigwa mziisi zimwenga, na kae ya Yelusalemu yolongozigwa na wanhu hawali Wayahudi, mbaka mchipindi chao cha kulongoza chonda chivike.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kaidi Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Baho hokua na vilaguso mdizua na muumwezi na mzinhondo. Wanhu wose mziisi wokwazaganyika ng'hani na holawila ng'humbi da bahali dili na gudemo. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Wanhu wosinduka kwa kudumba na kwa kulola mbuli zonda kulawilile muiisi, kwa vija udahi wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wotigisigwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Baho vonda wamone Mwanage Munhu yokwiza mdiwingu kwa udahi mkulu na Ukulu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Basi mbuli zino vonda zilawilile mweye imeni na mwinule vihanga venu, kwa vija ulohozi wenu wa habehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano kulawa mu mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Amala kawalaongela mfano uno; “Uloleni mkuyu na mibiki imwenga yose. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Chipindi chonda kuzuka mayani, mweye wenyego movimanya kua vuli da habehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Na mwahaona kulawilila kwa mbuli zino, mvimanye kua Ufaume wa Mulungu wa habehi ivija.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Kweli nowalongeleni, ulelo wonda wagaone gano hawabita mbaka mbuli zino zose zenele. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Isi na ulanga vobita, mbali mbuli zangu hazibita ng'o.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkale meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Itiganyeni, sekeinogeligwe na mbuli za ubananzi wowose mugima wenu kama umelo, ulevi na kugaya muugima uno, kwa vija zua ijo dodaha kwiza kwa kusinhukiza kama mtego vuwenzeka <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />kama vija ching'hungo. Iyo yowalawilila wanhu wose hohose chila hanhu muiisi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Basi mkale meso kuno mompula, Mulungu yawadahize kwa mbuli zonda zilawilile na kwima haulongozi mwa Mwanage Munhu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mmazua gose Yesu kakala kofunda Mui ng'anda ya Mulungu, na zua dihaswela, koita kuhumula mchigongo cha Mizeituni na kua uko chilo chose. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Na wanhu wose wakala wokwiza lukwiki Mui ng'anda ya Mulungu kutegeleza viyofunda.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Wotanda kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Chipindi chahabehi cha ulusona lwa migate ilibule hamila, lusona wokemigwa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Baho wakulu wa nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi za Musa wakala wowadumba wanhu, na ivo walonda nzila ya kumkoma Yesu kwa kifiso.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Mwenembago kamwingila Yuda ija yokemigwa Isikaliyote, yakalile imwe mwa waja wajalusona kumi na waidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuda kaita kwa wakulu wa nhambiko na waja wamilizi wa ng'anda ya Mulungu na kulonga nao vija viyalondile kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nao wadeng'helela na kuilumba kumwing'ha sente. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda ivija katogola na kasonga kulonda nyafasi ya kumuhinduka Yesu yahawa yaiyeka.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koitanda kuja Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Baho zua da lusona divika damigate ilibule hamila chipindi mwana bung'hukilalo wa pasaka kochinjigwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu kawalagiza Petulo na Yohana kwa malagizo gano kawalongela, “Gendeni mkatande goya lusona lwa Pasaka kwa mbuli yetu chize kuja.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Wamuuza, “Kulihi kuulonda cheye chikahatande?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu kawalongela, “Tegelezeni, vonda mwingile muikae, moiting'hanila na mulume imwe yapapile nongo ya mazi. Muinzeni mbaka muikae yondayengile, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />na mweye mulongeleni mwenekae, ‘Mfundaji kokuuza wahalihi uhelengo wakujila Pasaka nie na waluko wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Nayo kowalagusileni uhelengo mkulu uhambigwe goya muigolofa, chili na chila chinhu chikigwe goya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Waita na wavika chila chinhu kama Yesu viyawalongele, na waheka goya kwa mbuli ya kuja lusona wa Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndia ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Chipindi vichivikile, Yesu kakala kuja ndia hamwe na watumigwa muindia ya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Nivilonda ng'hani kuja lusona wa Pasaka hamwe na mweye, kabula sinadununzika! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kwa vija nowalongeleni,mbaka Mulungu vonda yawalohole wanhu wake wose na kuwalongoza. <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Amala Yesu kasola chikombe, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu na kalonga,” Soleni chino chikombe na mching'wele. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Nowalongeleni kua, kulawa sambi sing'wa kaidi divai ya nhunda da mzabibu mbaka Ufaume wa Mulungu vonda uvike.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Amala kasola chihande cha gate, na kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu na kaubena kuweng'ha waja watumigwa wake na kulonga,“Uno uo lukuli lwangu wolavigwa kwa mbuli yenu. Sang'haneni vino kwa kung'humbuka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ivija, viwakomeleze kuja kaweng'ha chikombe na kalonga, “Chikombe chino ni lagano da sambi dolagusa damu yangu ikwitika kwa mbuli yenu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Mbali mlole, ija yonihinduka kahamwe nanie muindia! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Nie mwanage Munhu nodanganika kama Mulungu viyalondile, mbali koluona munhu ija yonda yanihinduke!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Amala wasonga kuiuza wenyego kwa wenyego, yalihi kumwetu yodaha kusang'hana mbuli iyo?<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wogombela Ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Baho halawilila mwazaganyo mmwao kuno wotonga kua yalihi yonda yawe Mkulu mmwao. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu kawalongela, “Wafaume na wamhazi wowalongoza kwa ludabwa wanhu wao, na vilongozi womanyika kua 'Walava nying'ha wa wanhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Mbali mweye seke muigale nao, mbali yali mkulu mmwenu, kolondeka yawe kama mdodo kwa wose, na chilongozi kumwenu yawe kama mtumigwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kwaivo yalihi yali mkulu? Munhu ija yakalile hasi muindia kuja? Hebu ija msang'hanaji? Sio ija yakaliza kugaliligwa? Mbali nie nahano na mweye kama msang'hanaji. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Na mweye iyo msigale na nie chipindi chose mmagezo gangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />na kama vija Tatangu viyanitogole kulongoza, nanie nowatogola ivija, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />ili mdahe kuja ndia na kung'wa muufaume wangu na kukala mvigoda va ufaume, na kulamula makabila kumi na maidi ga Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagusa Petulo kokwiza kumbela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu kalonga, “Simoni, Simoni, tegeleza! Mwenembago kapula udaho wa kumgezani, kama mlimi viyobeta uhemba kulava mifuya. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mbali nikupulila gweye Simoni, nhogoli yako sekeihunguke, na gweye wahanibwelela, uwagele moyo wayago.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petulo kalonga, “Go Mndewa, niye nitogola kwingila na gweye mdigeleza hebu hata kudanganika!” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu kamwidika kamlongela, “Nokulongela gweye Petulo, kabula nzogolo hanakwika, gweye kokua kunibela mala nhatu kua hunimanyile.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itandeni na bung'hukila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Amala Yesu kawauza waluko wake,“Uja msimo viniwalonde muite bila mvuko wa sente hebu kadi da vivalo hebu vilatu, muhungukiligwa na chochose?” Wedikila, “Habule,” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mbali sambi,” “Kama kuna mkoba ya sente hebu kadi iyeka kolondeka uisole, na kama kwabule panga gula golole jako ukagule panga dimwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwa vija mayandiko yolonga, ‘Kahanganyigwa hamwe na wabananzi,’ Nna niye nowalongela mbuli ino yolondeka ivike kumwangu. Chandikiligwe niye cholondeka chivike.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Waja waluko wake wamlongela, “Mndewa lola hano hana mapanga maidi!” Nayo kalonga, “Imala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kopula kulugongo lwa Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu kaita mbaka kulugongo lwa mizeituni kama viikalile mazoela gake, na waluko wake wakala womuwinza. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Viwavikile uko, kawaloangela Waluko wake,”Puleni sekemwingile mmagezo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kainega nao hatali chiidogo kama vija hanhu hakupigisa dibwe, kafugama mavindi kapula. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Kalonga, “Tata,” “Kama yahadahika, nilavile madununzo gano. Sikama vinilonda, mbali sang'hana kama vuulonda.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Mtumigwa wa kwa Mulungu kamlawila na kumgela moyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Nayo Yesu yeli na usungu mkulu, kapula ng'hani mbaka fuguti dimlawa kama damu idwendeka muiisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Viyakomeleze kupula, kawabwelela waja waluko wake kawavika wawasa, kwavija wakala walegela kwa giogio. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Nayo kawauza, “Habali muwasa? Lamkeni mkapule, seke mwingile mmagezo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga nao, bumbila kulu da wanhu divika, kwa kulongozigwa na Yuda, ija mtumigwa wake imwe mwa waja kumi na waidi. Kaita behi na Yesu yapate kumlamsa kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Mbali Yesu kamuuza, ‘“Gweye Yuda! Komhinduka Mwanage Munhu kwa kumnonela?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Mbali waja wajalusona wa Yesu wakalile hamwe nayo, viwaonile yonda yalawilile, walonga, “Mndewa, chiwakanhe na mapanga getu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Munhu imwe mwa waja wajalusona kamkanha na panga gutwi da kulume ija mtumigwa wa Mkulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Mbali Yesu kalonga, “Lekeni!” Nayo kadigoga gutwi da ija munhu na kamhonya. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Amala Yesu kawalongela Vilongozi wa wakulu wa nhambiko, na wakulu wa wamilizi wa Kae ya Mulungu na waja wavele vilongozi wezile kumgela mmakono, “Ivo mweye mwiza na mapanga na viwenguwengu kama vija niye mgala ndwagi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mazua gose nikala na mweye muluhelengo lwa ng'anda ya Mulungu hamnigelile mmakono. Mbali chino icho chipindi chenu cha ulongozi wa ziza.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57">Matayo 26:57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maluko 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Amala wamgela Yesu mmakono, wamsola na waita nayo mbaka ukae kwa Mkulu wa nhambiko, mbali Petulo kamuwinza Yesu kwa hatali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Viwakomeleze kukoka moto haluhelengo, Petulo nayo kailumba nao waja wakalile wokota moto. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mtumigwa imwe wa chike viyamonile Petulo kakala habehi na uja moto, kambunhulila meso na kulonga, “Munhu ino nayo kakala hamwe na Yesu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Mbali Petulo kabela na kalonga, “Gweye muke, nie ata simanyile munhu iyo!” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Chipindi chidodo munhu imwenga kamona Petulo na kalonga, “Gweye ivija kwa miage Yesu!” Mbali Petulo kalonga, “Munhu gweye sio nie!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Viibitile kama saa dimwe vino, munhu imwenga kagendelela kugangamiza, “Kweli ino munhu nayo kakala hamwe na Yesu, kwa vija ino nayo Mgalilaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petulo kalonga, “Gwee munhu sichimanya chuulonga!” Bahaja viyakalile yolonga, nzogolo keka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Na Mndewa kamhindukila na kumlola Petulo, baho Petulo kakumbuka zija mbuli yalongiligwe na Mndewa, “Kabula nzogolo lelo hanakwika, gweye kokua kunibela mala nhatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petulo kalawa kunze na kulila kwa giogio.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamilizi womzeha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maluko 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Waja wanhu wakalile womkimila Yesu wasonga kumzeha na kumtoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Wamzingiliza chikumbi mmeso na kumuuza, yotela, “Chilongele yalihi yakutowile!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Wagendelela kulonga mbuli nyingi za kumliga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa mchitala cha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Viivikile imitondo, chitala cha wavele wa wanhu na wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi waiting'hanila, na wamgala Yesu mchitala icho. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Wamlongela, “Chilongele,” “Gweye iyo Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu?” Kawedika, “Hata nihawalongela, hamnitogola, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />na niye nihawauza mbuli, hamdaha kunidika. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Mbali kulawa sambi nie Mwanage Munhu kokala ubanzi wa mkono wa nhogolwa wa Mulungu yeli na udaho.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Wose wamuuza, “Gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu?” Yesu kawedika, “Mweye iyo mulonga iyo nie.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Amala walonga, “Cholonda choni kaidi! Cheye wenyego chimhulika viyolonga kwa mulomo wake mwenyego!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Amala chitala chimgala Yesu kwa Pilato, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />nao wasonga kulonga, “Chimona ino munhu viyovwizila wanhu wetu, kowagoma wanhu seke walihe kodi ya Mfaume wa Loma ivija koikema iyo Kilisito Mfaume.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Baho Pilato kamuuza Yesu, “Gweye iyo Mfaume wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye iyo ulonga.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato kawalongela waja Vilongozi wa Wakulu wa nhambiko na dija bumbila, “Niye siyona mbuli yabanange ya kumgela mchitala munhu ino!”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Mbali wao wagangamiza kulonga, “Ino mahala gake gowatenda wanhu wagale ndwagi mui Yudea yose. Kasongela uko Galilaya na sambi kavika hano Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato viyehulike gago kauza, “Ivo, munhu ino Mgalilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Baho Pilato viyamanyile kua munhu ino kolawa muulongozi wa Helode, kamgala kwa Helode yakalile uko Yelusalemu ivija. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ivo Helode kadeng'helela ng'hani viyamonile Yesu, kwa vija kazihulika mbuli zake na kwa chipindi chitali kakala yolonda kumona. Na kaidi katumanila kumona Yesu viyosang'hana uzonza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helode kamuuza mbuli nyingi, mbali Yesu kanyamala hupi. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi wakala womlongeleza Yesu kwa kugangamiza. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Amala Helode na wamilizi wake wamzeha Yesu na kumwehula. Wamvaza valo da kifaume na kumbweleza kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Mdizua ijo Helode na Pilato waikola umbwiga, mbali kabula ya mbuli ino wakala na uhasanyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolamuligwa akomigwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Baho Pilato kawakema hamwe waja vilongozi wa wakulu wa nhambiko, na vilongozi wamwenga na wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kawalongela, “Mweye mumgala munhu ino kumwangu na mumlonga kua kowaswangiza wanhu wagale ndwagi. Vinilolile ng'hani mbuli ino na mweye mlibaha, sionile diyabanange dakumgela mchitala kama mweye vumlonda. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Kaidi si nie tu, hata Helode haonile mbuli yoyose yabanange ino, ivo kalamula kumbweleza kumwetu. Kama vuumona wenyego munhu ino habanange jojose dimlonda yalamuligwe ifa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Baho nolagiza yalibuligwe mbalati amala nomlekesa. <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kwavija ikala mazoela gake Pilato kumlekesa mfungigwa imwe mchipindi cha lusona lwa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Mbali wanhu wose waguta nyangi hamwe, “Mlekese Balaba! Iyo Yesu yakomigwe!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Iyo Balaba kakala kekigwa mdigeleza kwa mbuli ya kukoma na kuswangiza wanhu wagale ndwagi mzikae. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato kalonda kumlekesa Yesu, kalonga nao kaidi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Mbali wao wagendelela kutoa nyangi kuno wolonga, “Yawambigwe mumsalaba! yawambigwe mumsalaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Mala ya kadatu Pilato kawauza, “Munhu ino katenda mbuli ilihi ihile? Niye siyonile mbuli yoyose yakumtenda yakomigwe. Ivo nolagiza yalibuligwe mbalati amala nomlekesa. <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Mbali wanhu wagendelela kutoa nyangi kwa ludabwa kuno wolonda Yesu yawambigwe. Nyangi zao zihuma. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Kwa ivo Pilato kalamula watende kama viwalonda. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kamvugulila ija munhu yakalile mdigeleza, yafungigwekwa mbuli ya kukoma na kuswangiza wanhu wagale ndwagi iwamulondile, na ivija kaweng'ha Yesu wamtende viwolonda.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu womuwamba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Viwakalile woita nayo, wamgoga munhu imwe yokemigwa Simoni mwene kae ya Kelene, yakalile kolawa mvijiji. Wamwamha wampapiza Msalaba wa Yesu, yausole hachisogo ha Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Bumbila kulu da wanhu dimuwinza Yesu, na waja wanachike wakalile womlilila na kulombokeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Baho Yesu kawahindukila na kawalongela, “Mewye biti wa Yelusalemu, seke mnililile mbali muililile wenyego na wanenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwa vija msimo wokwiza vija mondamlonge, ‘Wamweda wanachike waja wagane, waja zinda zao hazilelile, hebu matombo gao hagana kong'heza!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Baho wonda wasonge kuilongela Lugongo, ‘Chigwileni,’ na vigongo, ‘Mchigubike.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Manake kama wasang'hana vino kwa nie sibanange jojose, ivo yomtendelaze ija yabanange?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Wanhu wamwenga wabananzi waidi, wakomigwe hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Na viwavikile hanhu hokemigwa fuvu da ditwi, baho hawamuwambile Yesu hamwe na waja wabananzi waidi, imwe ubanzi wake wa kulume na imwenga ubanzi wake wa kumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu kalonga, “Go Tata ugele kumgongo kwa vija hamanyile goyotenda!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Waigolela vivalo vake kwa kutowa simbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Wanhu wema baho kuno womlola, nao Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wamzeha wolonga; “Kawahonya wamwenga, hebu na yaihonye mwenyego, kama iyo Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Na wamilizi nao weza na kumzeha, wamgalila divai isasile yang'we. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Nao wamlongela, “Kama gweye iyo Mfaume wa Wayahudi, ilohole mwenyego“'<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Haja hamsalaba, hachanha ya ditwi jake, hakala mayandiko yandikigwe, “INO IYO MFAUME WA WAYAHUDI.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Munhu imwe mwa waja wabananzi yawambigwe hamgwazo ha msalaba wa Yesu, kamliga Yesu kalonga, “Kama gweye iyo Kilisito ilohole mwenyego na uchilohole na cheye.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Mbali ija mbananzi imwenga kamkomhokela miage kalonga, “Gweye humdumba Mulungu hata chidogo? Gweye ivija kwamuibung'hukila? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Gweye na nie hachioneligwa, chilamuligwa kwa gaja gachibanange. Mbali munhu ino habanange mbuli yoyose. <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Amala ija mbananzi kamlonga, “Go Yesu sekeunisemwe vuukwingila Muufaume wako.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu kamwidika kamlongela, “Nokulongela kweli, lelo vino kokua hamwe na niye hanhu hali na unovu hanogile hoyakala Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodanganika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Baho ikala saa sita vino imisi, ziza dikala digubika isi yose kwa masaa madatu mbaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />kwavija zua dileka kubung'hula. Golole da ng'anda ya Mulungu didegeka vihande vidi kulawila hachanha mbaka hasi. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu kaguta nyangi na kalonga, Tata, mmakono gako nokwika muhe wangu.” Viyakomeleze kugalonga gano, kadanganika. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ija Akida viyaonile galawilile, kamtogola Mulungu kalonga, “Kweli ino munhu kakala yotogoligwa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Na wanhu wose wakalile baho, viwaonile gago gatendeke wabwela kumwao kuno weli na giogio kulu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Mbali waja wose wammanyile, hamwe na waja wanachike wakalile womuwinza kulawa Galilaya, wema kutali kuno wolola mbuli zino.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowandigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Basi hakala na munhu imwe yotogoligwa na Mulungu zina jake Yusufu. Iyo kakala mtumigwa Mchitala chikulu cha Wayahudi, yolawila muikae ya Alimataya, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Iyo hawatogolele wayage dija diwasang'hana, kakala yokalizila kwiza kwa Ufaume wa Mulungu. . <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Amala Yusufu kaita kwa Pilato na kapula yagweliligwe lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kauhulumusa lukuli uo kulawa Muumsalaba, na kauzinga sitili nzelu ya bei ng'hulu, na kawika mdipanga disongigwe muumwamba, haja hadipanga hahakalile hekigwe munhu yoyose. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Wakala woitanda kwingila Zua da kuhumula da Wayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Waja wanachike wakalile womsondelela Yesu kulawila Galilaya, Wamuwinza Yusufu, wadiona dija panga na vija lukuli lwa Yesu vuutambalazigwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Amala wabwela ukae, watanda vinung'ila na mavuta kogemigwa malihamu ga kuubaka lukuli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Mbali mdizua da kuhumula Wayahudi wahumula kama viilamuligwe muindagizi za Musa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Mdizua da mosi da juma, waja wanachike wavisola vija vinhung'ila wakalile wavika goya na kuita navo kudipanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Viwavikile wavika dija dibwe disegezigwa mumlomo mwa panga, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />mbali viwengila mgati, hawauonile ulukuli lwa Mndewa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Viwakalile wokanganya kwa mbuli iyo, bahaja wawaona wanhu waidi wakalile wavala vivalo vibung'huke kama lumwesa lwa ladi, wema behi nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Na waja wanachike viwakalile wang'hali wodumba, waidulika mbaka hasi. Mbali waja wanhu wawauza, “Habali momzambwila munhu yeli na ugima mwawafile? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Hano kahabule, kamala kuzilibuka! Seke muisemwe viyawalongele mchipindi chija viyakalile hamwe na mweye uko Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Ikala yolondeka, ‘Nie Mwanage Munhu ilondeka nigaligwe kwa wanhu weli na malozo, nao waniwambe Mumsalaba na mdizua da kadatu nizilibuke.<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Baho waja wanachike wazikumbuka mbuli izo ziyalongile Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Viwabwelile kulawa kudipanga, wawalongela mbuli zose waja watumigwa kumi na imwe na waja wamwenga wose. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Wanhu wao wakala Maliamu wa Magidala na Yoana na Malia mami yake Yakobo hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wailongoze hamwe nayo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Mbali waja watumigwa wa Yesu hawazitogole mbuli zilawile kwa waja wanachike kwa vija zioneka za ubozi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Hataivo, Petulo kema na kakimbilila kuja kudipanga. Viyainamile kusungulila mdipanga, kaiona sitili iiyeka ipumbuluka, mbali haonile kinhu chimwenga. Nayo kaita zake kuno koiuza choni chilawilile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12">Maluko 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13">13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Zua idija, waluko waidi wa Yesu wakala mnzila woita mchijiji cha Eamau, utali wa maili saba vino kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Baho wakala woilongela wenyego kwa wenyego mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Viwakalile woilongela mbuli izo, bahaja Yesu kalawila na kuilongoza hamwe nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Mbali wafisigwa meso gao seke wammanye. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu kawauza, mbuli zilihi izo zimsimulila kuno mogenda?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Nao wema kuno vihanga vao vooneka vina giogio. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Munhu imwe yokemigwa Kiliopa, kamuuza Yesu, Ivo! gweye iyo nyambenyambe uiyeka mui kae ya Yelusalem, manake huzimanya hata mbuli zilawile hano?<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu kawauza “Mbuli zilihi?” Wamlongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">'“Mbuli za Yesu wa Nazaleti. Iyo yawile mlagusi wa Mulungu, yeli na udaho mkulu mzimbuli zake na mzisang'hano zake, mbaka haulongozi ha Mulungu na haulongozi ha Wanhu wose. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Vilongozi wa wakulu wa nhambiko na Vilongozi wetu wamlava na kulamula yakomigwe, nao wamuwamba mumsalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Cheye chimtamanila kua nayo iyo yahailohole isi ya Izilaeli. Mbali lelo zua da kadatu tangia mbuli izo vizilawilile. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kaidi wanachike wamwenga mdibumbila jetu wachisinhusa. Kwa vija imitondo ng'hani waita kudipanga, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />mbali hawaonile lukuli lwake. Wabwela na kulonga, wagaona malaguso ga wanhu wa kuulunga kwa Mulungu walongile Yesu mgima. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Wamwenga wetu waita kugamapanga kulola dija dilongigwe na wao wana chike, mbali hawamonile Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Mbona mwawabozi ivo na mioyo yenu midala kutogola gaja galongigwe na walagusi wa Mulungu! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ivo, Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu halondeke kudununzigwa, na baho yengile muukulu wake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yesu kawafambulila gaja gose gandikigwe mmayandiko gekigwe kwa mbuli yake kulawa kwa Musa mbaka kwa walagusi wose. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Viwakalile behi na kuvika kuchijiji chiwoita, Yesu katenda kama kogendelela na mwanza, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />mbali wao wampula walonga, “Kala hamwe nacheye kwavija zua diswa, na chilo chokwingila.” Baho kengila mchijiji na kakala hamwe nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Viyakalile hasi nao kuja ndia, kasola gate, kaupulila unovu wa Mulungu, kaubena kaweng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Bahaja meso gao gabunhuligwa, wammanya kua iyo Yesu, mbali nayo kahalawa hamwao. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Baho, wailongela wenyego, “Ivo, hachipatile chimuhemuhe cha ndeng'helo mmoyo viyakalile yofambula mayandiko gekigwe kwa mbuli ya Mulungu vichikalile mnzila?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Wasegela bahaja, wabwela Yelusalemu, wawavika waja watumigwa kumi na imwe na waja wamwenga wakalile nao waikunzanya hamwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />na walonga “Kweli Yesu kazilibuka! Nayo kamlawila Simon!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Baho, waja wajalusona wa Yesu waidi wawalongela gaja galawilile mnzila na viwammanyile viyabenile gate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila waluko wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang’hano za Wasenga 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Viwakalile wowalongela gago, Yesu mwenyego kema hamwe nao kawalongela, “Mkale na utindiwala.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Wasinhuka na wagwa chigudemo wavimanya waona mzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Mbali Yesu kawauza, “Habali mgwa fufunhende? Habali hamtogola mmoyo? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Loleni makono na magulu gangu, iyo nie mwenyego. Nibabaseni mlole, manake mzimu wabule lukuli hebu mivuha kama vumniona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Viyamalile kulonga ivo kawalagusila makono na magulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Viwakalile wang'hali kutogola, kwa mbuli ya ndeng'helelo yao na kukanganyika kwao, kawauza, “Mnayo ndia yoyose hano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Wamwing'ha luhande lwa somba yokigwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />nayo kakisola kakija kuno wose womlola.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Amala kawalongela, “Zino izo mbuli ziniwalongele vichikalile hamwe na mweye, kua ikala yolondeka gavikile mayandiko gandikigwe kwa mbuli yangu muindagizi ya Musa na mgamayandiko ga walagusi wa Mulungu na mchitabu cha Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Amala kawadahiza umanyi wao ili wavimanye mayandiko gekigwe kwambuli ya Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />kawalongela, “Vino ivo viyandikigwe, kua Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu kolondeka yadununzike na mdizua da kadatu yazilibuke, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />na kua yolondeka kwa Zina jake wanhu wose kulawila Yelusalemu, waliguliligwe kua wanhu wolondeka kuleka malozo gao na walekeseligwe malozo gao. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Mweye iyo mzilolile mbuli izo. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Nanie mwenyego nowatumileni ija Tata yawalike komgala, mbali beteni kuno muikae mbaka vondambokele udaho ulawa kuchanha.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kasoligwa kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maluko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sang’hano za Wasenga 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Amala kawalongoza kulawa kunze muikae mbaka Betania, kenula makono kuchanha kawapulila unovu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Viyakalile yowapulila unovu wa Mulungu, kenuligwa na kuwaleka kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Wao wamfugamila, amala wabwela Yelusalemu weli na ndeng'helo ng'hulu, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />na wakala chipindi chose Muikae ya Mulungu womtogola Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>